ull,null,null,null]}},"opening":{"day":"2023-01-26","start":"18:30:00","timestamp":"2023-01-26T18:30:00+01:00","end":"21:30:00","is_only_by_appointment":false},"visit_profile":{"list":[337],"translations":{"fr":["Highlight"],"nl":["Highlight"],"en":["Highlight"],"de":["Highlight"],"it":["Highlight"],"sp":["Highlight"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"tags":["kids","annee_art_nouveau"],"is_part_of":"Ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau","accessibilities":{"list":[255,263,265,266],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"it":["Accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"sp":["Habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"pt":[null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-13T02:36:58+01:00","published_at":"2022-11-14T11:30:16+01:00","backoffice_id":265542,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.34548517720937},{"id":549974,"date_start":"2023-01-27","date_end":"2023-03-05","date_next":"2023-02-13","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,41],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Installation, performance"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Installatie, performance"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Installation, performance"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Installation, Performance"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici","Installazioni, performance"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte","Instalaci\u00f3n, performance"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":"rosa (iel, leur) est un\u00b7e serveur\u00b7e f\u00e9ministe qui voyage entre diff\u00e9rents lieux, fournissant une infrastructure mobile. En janvier et f\u00e9vrier 2023, la vitrine de Constant deviendra un espace d\u2019exploration des possibilit\u00e9s au sein d\u2019un\u00b7e serveur\u00b7e partag\u00e9\u00b7e.","longdescr":"Vernissage installation : jeudi 26 janvier 2023 d\u00e8s 18h00\r\nAtelier : dimanche 5 mars 2023 de 14h00 \u00e0 16h00\r\n\r\nrosa (iel, leur) est un\u00b7e serveur\u00b7e f\u00e9ministe qui voyage entre diff\u00e9rents lieux, fournissant une infrastructure mobile d\u2019apprentissage, de documentation et d\u2019exp\u00e9riences pour les rencontres qui ont eu lieu pendant le projet A Traversal Network of Feminist Servers. rosa n\u2019est pas seulement son hardware ou son logiciel, mais aussi la multitude de relations qui sont cr\u00e9\u00e9es autour de la fabrication, de la maintenance et de la transmission de cette infrastructure : les processus qui sont r\u00e9alis\u00e9s, la charge affective de leur action, les communaut\u00e9s qui les entourent. \r\n\r\nEn janvier et f\u00e9vrier 2023, la vitrine de Constant deviendra un espace d\u2019exploration des possibilit\u00e9s de d\u00e9placement des langues au sein d\u2019un\u00b7e serveur\u00b7e partag\u00e9\u00b7e. Ces langues, telles des vernaculaires, se sont d\u00e9velopp\u00e9es pendant chaque nouvelle it\u00e9ration qui a eu lieu \u00e0 Rotterdam (Varia, LURK), Bucarest (hypha), Graz (esc mkl), Ath\u00e8nes (Feminist Hack Meetings) et Bruxelles (Constant), en compagnie des artistes et chercheureuses Marloes de Valk et ooooo. Quels sont les langages qui composent rosa en tant qu\u2019espace au-del\u00e0 de ceux qui ont \u00e9t\u00e9 h\u00e9rit\u00e9s par leur syst\u00e8me d\u2019exploitation et leurs d\u00e9pendances ? Comment ces langages peuvent-ils \u00eatre remis en question et r\u00e9\u00e9crits ?\r\n\r\n* Le titre de cette installation, cr\u00e9e in situ par Alice Strete & Cristina Cochior (Varia), provient d\u2019une conf\u00e9rence d\u2019Alexis Pauline Gumbs dans laquelle elle explique qu\u2019elle imagine son livre \"Dub : Finding Ceremony\" comme un oracle. Ses instructions ont \u00e9t\u00e9 adapt\u00e9es pour accueillir les personnes acc\u00e9dant au serveur rosa.","performers":"Alice Strete (artiste); Cristina Cochior (artiste)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"nl":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":"rosa (zhij, hen) is een feministische server die reist tussen verschillende locaties. Ze bieden een mobiele infrastructuur. In januari en februari 2023 wordt het raam van Constant een verkenningsruimte voor de mogelijkheden van een gedeelde server.","longdescr":"Opening installatie: donderdag 26 januari 2023 vanaf 18:00\r\nWorkshop: Zondag 5 maart 2023 van 14u00 tot 16u00\r\n\r\nrosa (zhij, hen) is een feministische server die reist tussen verschillende locaties. Ze bieden een mobiele infrastructuur voor de leer-, experimenteer- en documentatiemomenten die plaats hebben tijdens het project A Traversal Network of Feminist Servers (ATNOFS). rosa bestaan niet enkel uit hard- en software, maar ook uit de veelheid van relaties die worden gesmeed rond het maken, onderhouden en doorgeven van deze server-infrastructuur: onder andere in de processen die lopen, de affectieve lading van acties, de gemeenschappen rondom.\r\n\r\nIn januari en februari wordt het raam van Constant een verkenningsruimte voor de mogelijkheden om met talen te jongleren op een gedeelde server. Er vonden meerdere iteraties van ATNOFS plaats: in Rotterdam (Varia, LURK), Boekarest (hypha), Graz (esc mkl), Athene (Feminist Hack Meetings) en in Brussel (Constant). Deze sessies werden telkens vergezeld door de kunstenaars \/ onderzoekers Marloes de Valk en ooooo. Centraal was dat elke iteratie bijdroeg aan een informele rosa taal. Want, welke talen, naast de standaardtalen van het besturingssysteem en dependencies, helpen rosa transformeren tot een ruimte om te componeren en te schrijven? Hoe kunnen deze talen in vraag worden gesteld en worden herschreven?.\r\n\r\n* De titel van deze installatie - in situ gecre\u00eberd door Alice Strete & Cristina Cochior (Varia) - komt van een lezing door Alexis Pauline Gumbs waarin ze uitlegt hoe ze zich haar boek \"Dub: Finding Ceremony\" voorstelt als een orakel. Haar instructies werden aangepast tot welkomstbericht voor bezoekers van de rosa server.","performers":"Alice Strete (kunstenares); Cristina Cochior (kunstenares)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"en":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":"rosa (they, them) is a feminist server that travels between different locations, providing a mobile infrastructure. In January and February 2023, the window of Constant will become a space for exploring the possibilities of a shared server.","longdescr":"Opening installation: Thursday 26 January 2023 from 18:00 on\r\nWorkshop: Sunday 5 March 2023 from 14:00 to 16:00\r\n\r\nrosa (they, them) is a feminist server that travels between different locations, providing a mobile infrastructure for learning, documentation, and experiments for the meetings that happened during the A Traversal Network of Feminist Servers project. rosa is not only its constituting hardware or software, but also the multitude of relations which are created around the making, maintaining and passing on of this infrastructure: the processes that are performed, the affective charge of their actioning, the communities around them. \r\n\r\nIn January and February 2023, the window of Constant will become a space for exploring the possibilities of shifting languages within a shared server. Vernaculars have developed from each situated iteration in Rotterdam (Varia, LURK), Bucharest (hypha), Graz (esc mkl), Athens(Feminist Hack Meetings) and Brussels (Constant), accompanied by artists and researchers Marloes de Valk and ooooo. What languages compose rosa as a space beyond those that were inherited through their operating system and their dependencies? How can these languages be questioned and rewritten ?\r\n\r\n* The title of this installation, created in situ by Alice Strete & Cristina Cochior (Varia), comes from a lecture by Alexis Pauline Gumbs in which she explains how she imagines her book \u2019Dub: Finding Ceremony\u2019 as an oracle. Her instructions were adapted to welcome those accessing the rosa server.","performers":"Alice Strete (artist); Cristina Cochior (artist)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"de":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"it":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"sp":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"pt":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"},"cn":{"name":"Now, think of a question that is at stake for you","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.549974"}},"place":{"id":243917,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Constant est une association sans but lucratif bas\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles, active depuis 1997 dans les domaines de l\u2019art et des m\u00e9dias.\r\nConstant est un atelier interdisciplinaire qui se concentre sur la culture et l\u2019\u00e9thique du web. La pratique artistique de Constant est inspir\u00e9e par la fa\u00e7on avec laquelle les infrastructures technologiques, les \u00e9changes de donn\u00e9es et les logiciels d\u00e9terminent nos vies quotidiennes. Quelques chantiers importants sont le logiciel libre, les alternatives au copyright et le (cyber)f\u00e9minisme.\r\nDe fa\u00e7on r\u00e9guli\u00e8re Constant organise des ateliers, des print-parties, des balades, des performances, des lectures et des rencontres \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019 pour un public qui aime l\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation, la discussion et des \u00e9changes de toutes sortes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Constant vzw","address_street_name":"Fortstraat","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Fortstraat, 5","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Constant is een vereniging zonder winstoogmerk werkzaam in het gebied tussen kunst en media.\r\nHet is een interdisciplinaire werkplaats die zich bezighoudt met de cultuur en ethiek van het web. De artistieke praktijk van Constant wordt ge\u00efnspireerd door de manier waarop technologische infrastructuren, data-uitwisseling en software ons dagelijkse leven bepalen. Belangrijke werkterreinen zijn vrije software, alternatieven op auteursrecht en (cyber)feminisme.\r\nConstant organiseert regelmatig workshops, print-parties, wandelingen en \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019-bijeenkomsten voor een publiek dat houdt van experimenten, discussies en uitwisselingen allerhande.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Constant","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"],"de":["S\u00fcden"],"it":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":6251,"location":{"lat":50.829913,"lon":4.34345951},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-02-13T03:05:09+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:19:59+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":243917,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Constant est une association sans but lucratif bas\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles, active depuis 1997 dans les domaines de l\u2019art et des m\u00e9dias.\r\nConstant est un atelier interdisciplinaire qui se concentre sur la culture et l\u2019\u00e9thique du web. La pratique artistique de Constant est inspir\u00e9e par la fa\u00e7on avec laquelle les infrastructures technologiques, les \u00e9changes de donn\u00e9es et les logiciels d\u00e9terminent nos vies quotidiennes. Quelques chantiers importants sont le logiciel libre, les alternatives au copyright et le (cyber)f\u00e9minisme.\r\nDe fa\u00e7on r\u00e9guli\u00e8re Constant organise des ateliers, des print-parties, des balades, des performances, des lectures et des rencontres \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019 pour un public qui aime l\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation, la discussion et des \u00e9changes de toutes sortes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Constant vzw","address_street_name":"Fortstraat","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Fortstraat, 5","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Constant is een vereniging zonder winstoogmerk werkzaam in het gebied tussen kunst en media.\r\nHet is een interdisciplinaire werkplaats die zich bezighoudt met de cultuur en ethiek van het web. De artistieke praktijk van Constant wordt ge\u00efnspireerd door de manier waarop technologische infrastructuren, data-uitwisseling en software ons dagelijkse leven bepalen. Belangrijke werkterreinen zijn vrije software, alternatieven op auteursrecht en (cyber)feminisme.\r\nConstant organiseert regelmatig workshops, print-parties, wandelingen en \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019-bijeenkomsten voor een publiek dat houdt van experimenten, discussies en uitwisselingen allerhande.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"