+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Since 2016, Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery exhibits established and emerging artists in Brussels and in a selection of international art fairs. Our represented artists are actively committed to questioning social, political and architectural spaces. They present a very diverse body of work \u2013 inculding installation, video, sculpture, painting and drawing \u2013 and display pure and powerful aesthetics. The gallery is intended as an adaptable experimentation space, allowing the artists to stretch the boundaries of their chosen discipline, either by testing and distorting the physical frame of the work itself, or by exploring its significance in the social sphere.\r\nIn 2018, the gallery moved to a new location and developed an ambitious exhibition programme, dedicated to further a productive dialogue between international artists, curators and institutions.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"LAUB","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_we