contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545956"},"pt":{"name":"visite guid\u00e9e par la propri\u00e9taire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","email":"info@events-at-horta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545956"},"cn":{"name":"visite guid\u00e9e par la propri\u00e9taire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","email":"info@events-at-horta.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545956"}},"place":{"id":246311,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Max Hallet","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 346","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Maison datant de 1904, ex\u00e9cut\u00e9e d'apr\u00e8s les plans de Victor Horta, elle est situ\u00e9e sur la prestigieuse avenue Louise. L'avocat Max Hallet la fit construire afin d\u2019y habiter mais aussi d\u2019y recevoir ses amis et clients dans un cadre somptueux, m\u00eame si la fa\u00e7ade pr\u00e9sente une certaine sobri\u00e9t\u00e9. \r\n\r\nLe b\u00e2timent prend place sur une large parcelle \u2014 14 m\u00e8tres ! \u2014 appartenant \u00e0 la famille de l\u2019\u00e9pouse de Hallet, les Timberman, riche famille bourgeoise et lib\u00e9rale. \r\n\r\nLes Hallet-Timberman n\u2019y passeront qu\u2019une vingtaine d\u2019ann\u00e9es, d\u00e9m\u00e9nageant ensuite \u00e0 l\u2019avenue des Nations (actuelle avenue Franklin Roosevelt).","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Max Hallethuis","address_street_name":"Louizalaan","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Louizalaan, 346","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Dit huis werd gebouwd in 1904 volgens de plannen van Victor Horta. Het is gelegen op de prestigieuze Louizalaan. Advocaat Max Hallet woonde hier, en ontving er vrienden en cli\u00ebnten. \r\n\r\nHet gebouw staat op een groot stuk grond \u2013 de gevel is 14 meter! \u2013 dat eigendom was van de familie van Hallets vrouw, een rijke, liberale familie. \r\n\r\nHet koppel Hallet-Timberman woonde hier maar een twintigtal jaar, ze verhuisden naar de Nati\u00ebnlaan (nu Franklin Rooseveltlaan).","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Max Hallet House","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 346","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"House dating from 1904, built according to the plans of V. Horta and offering a symphony of colours, whorls and lights to lift the heart and please the eyes. The lawyer Max Hallet had it built to receive his friends and clients in a magnificent setting. Victor Horta built it in the image of its occupant, laying out rooms for living and areas for receiving visitors.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Max Hallet","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 346","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das H\u00f4tel Max Hallet stammt aus dem Jahr 1904 und wurde nach den Pl\u00e4nen von Victor Horta erbaut. Es besticht mit einer Symphonie der Farben, Voluten und Lichteffekten. Der Anwalt Max Hallet lie\u00df das Geb\u00e4ude erbauen, um seine Freunde und Kunden in einem hochherrschaftlichen Rahmen empfangen zu k\u00f6nnen. Victor Horta orientierte sich an den Bed\u00fcrfnissen seines Auftraggebers und richtete sowohl Wohn- als auch Empfangsbereiche ein.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Max Hallet","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 346","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Max Hallet","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Louise, 346","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Max Hallet","address_street_name":"Avenue Louise","address_street_number":"346","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@events-at-horta.be","website":"http:\/\/www.victorhorta.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 58 34","phone_booking":null,"address