s des frais d'inscription ou membre comme dans les structures de sport\/gyms\/clubs: on peut toujours payer par cours; tr\u00e8s pratique pour un court s\u00e9jour \u00e0 Bruxelles! Vous pouvez commencer quand on veut pendant l'ann\u00e9e, et venir uniquement 1 fois. \r\nSi vous restez plus longtemps, optez pour une carte de 5 cours \u00e0 50 euros ou 10 cours \u00e0 90 euros. Vous pouvez aussi utiliser votre carte pour nos cours a Etterbeek, Bruxelles (metro Schuman\/Merode) pour zumba lundi, mardi, mercredi, dimanche.\r\n- M\u00e9lange sympathique des belges et expatri\u00e9s dans nos cours, sympathique pour trouver des co-patriotes et de s'approcher aux belges qui vivent ici :) et ne pas seulement rester \"tourist(e)\".\r\n- Ne restez pas isol\u00e9(e) dans votre chambre d'h\u00f4tel le soir\/week-end: venez passer un bon moment en groupe! Chez nous une ambiance amusante, d\u00e9contract\u00e9z, non-comp\u00e9titive et accueillant pour des nouvelles personnes.\r\n- Nous avons aussi des cours de zumba lundi, mardi, mercredi et dimanche et un cours d'abdos-fessiers-bras les dimanches \u00e0 Etterbeek, Bruxelles.\r\n- Stages de danse; une opportunit\u00e9 d'apprendre par des professeurs sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s d'ici. Example: Salsa et Bachata lady-styling, Bollywood, Danse orientale... info ici:\r\nhttps:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com\/stages-de-danse.html\r\n- Salles spacieuses et facile \u00e0 ventiler.\r\n- Site web: www.danceandzumbafun.com\r\nBienvenue \u00e0 nous joindre! Sofie","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":"+32 484 66 10 00","phone_booking":"+32 484 66 10 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"nl":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"en":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":"Zumba\u00ae for adults & teens very danceable and dynamic! Latin songs, popular hits and music from all over the world. More than just getting back in shape, an hour of Zumba will bring you a smile even if stress or clouds have invaded your day... With our team, the atmosphere is assured in each class :)","longdescr":"- Thursdays 19h00-20h00\r\n- Advance registration required please (1 or several dates): info@danceandzumbafun.com tel: 0484\/661 000\r\n- No inscription or membership fees as in sports structures\/gyms\/clubs: you can always pay per class; very convenient for a short stay in Brussels! You can start whenever you want during the year, and come only once. \r\nIf you stay longer, opt for a 5 class card at 50 eur or 10 classes at 90 eur. You can also use your card for our zumba classes in Etterbeek, Brussels (metro Schuman\/Merode) Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Sunday.\r\n- Nice mix of Belgians and expatriates in our classes; you might find co-patriots and great to approach Belgians who live here :) and not just remain \"a tourist\".\r\n- Don't stay isolated in your hotel room at night\/weekend: come and have a good time in a group! We have a fun, relaxed, non-competitive and welcoming atmosphere for new participants.\r\n- We also have zumba Mondays, Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Sundays + an abs-butt-arms class on Sundays in Etterbeek, Brussels.\r\n- Also dance workshops, example: Salsa and Bachata lady-styling, Bollywood, Belly dancing... see here: https:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com\/dance.html\r\n- Spacious venues, easy to ventilate.\r\n- Website: www.danceandzumbafun.com\r\nWelcome to join us! Sofie","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"de":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"it":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"sp":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"pt":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"},"cn":{"name":"Zumba\u00ae dancing","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.danceandzumbafun.com","email":"info@danceandzumbafun.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540016"}},"place":{"id":279604,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Dance and Zumba Fun","address_street_name":"Rue Edimbourg","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Edimbourg, 16","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_pr