":["Art nouveau y art d\u00e9co"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe"],"it":["Accessibile","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti"],"sp":["Habilitado","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-13T02:07:27+01:00","published_at":"2021-04-12T11:38:28+02:00","backoffice_id":230572,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.085803768349643},{"id":551261,"date_start":"2023-02-20","date_end":"2023-02-24","date_next":"2023-02-20","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen","it":"Animazioni","sp":"Animaciones","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":"Victor le cochon-tirelire organise une f\u00eate de Carnaval dans sa vieille ferme. L\u2019aiderez-vous \u00e0 la remettre en \u00e9tat pour accueillir ses invit\u00e9s ?\u202f","longdescr":"La ferme de Victor se pr\u00e9pare avec excitation aux f\u00eates de Carnaval ! Apr\u00e8s tout, il s\u2019agit tout de m\u00eame de la f\u00eate pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e de Victor le cochon-tirelire ! Il l\u2019organise depuis des jours ! De Paula la vache \u00e0 Pierre le cheval, tous ses amis animaux y sont invit\u00e9s. Victor veut donc, pour l\u2019occasion, transformer sa ferme en un lieu fantastique o\u00f9 tout le monde pourra faire la f\u00eate. L\u2019ancienne ferme a cependant besoin d\u2019un petit lifting. Aiderez-vous Victor le cochon-tirelire \u00e0 effectuer ses r\u00e9parations ? En r\u00e9alisant diverses missions \u00e0 travers tout le mus\u00e9e, vous arriverez \u00e0 r\u00e9parer la ferme de Victor et \u00e0 la rendre plus belle. Qui sait ? Peut-\u00eatre recevrez-vous un beau cadeau \u00e0 la fin de la qu\u00eate ?  \r\n\r\nExplorez le mus\u00e9e au moyen de livrets d\u2019activit\u00e9s adapt\u00e9s \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2ge de votre enfant. Les livrets sont disponibles en fran\u00e7ais et en n\u00e9erlandais. Le jeu est supervis\u00e9 par les parents (ou d\u2019autres superviseurs) et constitue une belle sortie pour toute la famille. Si vous souhaitez visiter le mus\u00e9e avec un groupe d\u2019enfants plus important, nous vous invitons \u00e0 r\u00e9server votre visite via notre site web et \u00e0 consulter les livrets de l\u2019\u202f\u00ab\u202fEnqu\u00eate au mus\u00e9e\u202f\u00bb :  une activit\u00e9 gratuite et plus  adapt\u00e9e aux grands groupes. \r\n\r\nQUAND : La ferme de Victor ouvre ses portes du lundi 20 f\u00e9vrier au vendredi 24 f\u00e9vrier 2023. De 9h00 \u00e0 17h00.  \r\n\r\nPOUR QUI : Tous les amis des animaux de 4 \u00e0 6 ans et tous les futurs agriculteurs de 7 \u00e0 12 ans sont invit\u00e9s \u00e0 retrousser leurs manches.  \r\n\r\nDUREE : L\u2019aventure \u00e0 la ferme dure de 45 minutes \u00e0 1h. \r\n\r\nPRIX : Victor le cochon-tirelire souhaite l\u2019aide du plus grand nombre. Notre activit\u00e9 est donc totalement GRATUITE ! \r\n\r\nUne activit\u00e9 labellis\u00e9e\u202f\u00ab\u202fMarmaille & co\u202f\u00bb","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 221 22 06","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"nl":{"name":"Krokuskriebels op de NBBoerderij !","shortdescr":"Victor het spaarvarken organiseert een carnavalsfeest op zijn NBBoerderij. Help jij mee zijn boerderij opknappen?","longdescr":"De krokusvakantie zorgt voor gezonde spanning op de NBBoerderij. Carnaval is namelijk een van d\u00e9 favoriete feestdagen van Victor het spaarvarken! Victor is al dagenlang bezig met het organiseren van een feestje. Van Paula de koe tot Pierre het paard, alle boerderijvriendjes zijn uitgenodigd. Victor wil zijn boerderij omtoveren tot een fantastische plek waar iedereen het feestbeest kan uithangen. De oude NBBoerderij is toe aan een opknapbeurt. Help jij Victor het spaarvarken met de reparatie? Via verschillende opdrachten in het museum kan jij Victors boerderij stap voor stap mooier \u00e9n beter maken. En wie weet verdien je aan het einde van de zoektocht een feestelijk cadeautje!  \r\n\r\nVerken het museum aan de hand van speelse doe-boekjes op maat van de leeftijd van jouw kind. De boekjes zijn zowel in het Frans als in het Nederlands te verkrijgen. Het spel wordt begeleid door de ouders (of andere begeleiders) en is een fijne uitstap voor het hele gezin.  Als u het museum met een grotere groep kinderen wilt bezoeken, nodigen wij u uit om uw bezoek te reserveren via onze website en de speurtochtboekjes te raadplegen. Deze gratis aangeboden activiteit is beter aangepast aan grote groepen.  \r\n\r\nWANNEER: Victors boerderij opent de deuren van maandag 20 februari tot vrijdag 24 februari 2023, telkens van 9u tot 17u. \r\n\r\nVOOR WIE: Alle dierenvrienden van 4 tot 6 jaar en alle boeren-in-sp\u00e9 van 7 tot 12 jaar zijn welkom om hun handen uit de mouwen te steken. \r\n\r\nDUUR: Het avontuur op de boerderij duurt ongeveer 45 minuten tot 1 uur. \r\n\r\nPRIJS: Victor het spaarvarken kan alle hulp gebruiken. Onze activiteit is dan ook volledig GRATIS!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"en":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"de":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"it":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"sp":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"pt":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"},"cn":{"name":"Explor\u2019action masqu\u00e9e \u00e0 la ferme\u202f!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","email":"museum@nbb.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551261"}},"place":{"id":220155,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 2018, le mus\u00e9e de la Banque nationale de Belgique est install\u00e9 dans un magnifique b\u00e2timent bancaire datant du XIXe si\u00e8cle. \r\n\r\nUn premier circuit dans le mus\u00e9e aborde les r\u00f4les d\u2019une banque centrale \u00e0 travers une sc\u00e9nographie interactive. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son audioguide, le visiteur peut ainsi tant\u00f4t en apprendre un peu plus sur l\u2019\u00e9mission des pi\u00e8ces et des billets, tant\u00f4t tester ses connaissances sur l\u2019euro ou encore \u00eatre amen\u00e9 \u00e0 contr\u00f4ler le niveau d\u2019inflation. \r\n\r\nLe second circuit retrace l\u2019\u00e9volution des moyens de payement et fait la part belle aux collections historiques du mus\u00e9e. Monnaies marchandises, anciens objets de change, anciennes pi\u00e8ces et billets se c\u00f4toient ainsi dans une fresque th\u00e9matique et chronologique qui fera voyager le visiteur dans le temps et \u00e0 travers le monde.\r\n\r\nEnfin, le dernier circuit regroupe une s\u00e9rie d\u2019objets qui d\u00e9montre \u00e0 quel point l\u2019argent est pr\u00e9sent dans notre quotidien.\r\n\r\nLes visites de groupe sont organis\u00e9es \u00e0 partir de 10 personnes - maximum 25. Elles sont gratuites et durent environ 1 heure. Les r\u00e9servations se font via le formulaire en ligne disponible sur le site internet http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/fr\/booking. \r\nRenseignements : 02 221 22 06 \u2013 museum@nbb.be","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Warmoesberg","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Warmoesberg, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 2018 is het museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb in een prachtig 19de-eeuwse bankgebouw ondergebracht.\r\n\r\nAan de hand van interactieve opstellingen focust een eerste parcours in het museum op de taken van een centrale bank. Met behulp van een audiogids kan de bezoeker meer te weten komen over de uitgifte van munten en biljetten, zijn of haar kennis van de euro testen of proberen de inflatie onder controle te houden.\r\nHet tweede parcours schetst de evolutie van de betaalmiddelen en zet hierbij de collecties van het museum in de kijker. Goederengeld, oude ruilmiddelen, munten en biljetten vormen een thematisch en chronologisch geheel, waarbij de bezoeker wordt meegenomen op een reis in de tijd en over heel de wereld.\r\nHet derde parcours tenslotte toont een aantal voorwerpen waarmee wordt aangetoond hoe sterk geld aanwezig is in ons dagelijkse leven.\r\n\r\nGroepsbezoeken kunnen vanaf 10 personen, maximum 25. Ze zijn gratis en duren ongeveer 1 uur. Reserveren graag via de website van het museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl\/booking.\r\nMeer informatie: tel 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Museum of the National Bank of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since 2018 the museum of the National Bank of Belgium is housed in a splendid 19t century bank building situates at a mere 10-minute walk from the Central Station.\r\n\r\nThe first part of the exhibition pays particular attention to the role and the functions of the National Bank. By use of an audio guide and interactive displays, the visitor will no doubt discover lots of interesting facts about the issue of notes and coins, test their knowledge of the euro, or even try to control the rate of inflation.\r\n\r\nThe second part paints an overall picture of the evolution of money, and showcases many wonderful objects from the museum collection. Commodity money, diverse and peculiar objects once used for bartering, coins and notes... These many various pieces are purposely put in a thematical and chronological context which in the end will provide the visitor with a fascinating overview.\r\n\r\nThe third part of the exhibition proves just how much money is present in our day to day life by displaying a wide range of objects, some everyday and trivial, some quirky.\r\n\r\nGroup visits can be from 10 people up to 25. They are free and take about 1 hour. Please book via the website of the museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/en\/booking.\r\nMore information: 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":["Centro"],"sp":["Centro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":592,"location":{"lat":50.84984775,"lon":4.35727802},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-02-11T08:05:21+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:39+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":220155,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 2018, le mus\u00e9e de la Banque nationale de Belgique est install\u00e9 dans un magnifique b\u00e2timent bancaire datant du XIXe si\u00e8cle. \r\n\r\nUn premier circuit dans le mus\u00e9e aborde les r\u00f4les d\u2019une banque centrale \u00e0 travers une sc\u00e9nographie interactive. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 son audioguide, le visiteur peut ainsi tant\u00f4t en apprendre un peu plus sur l\u2019\u00e9mission des pi\u00e8ces et des billets, tant\u00f4t tester ses connaissances sur l\u2019euro ou encore \u00eatre amen\u00e9 \u00e0 contr\u00f4ler le niveau d\u2019inflation. \r\n\r\nLe second circuit retrace l\u2019\u00e9volution des moyens de payement et fait la part belle aux collections historiques du mus\u00e9e. Monnaies marchandises, anciens objets de change, anciennes pi\u00e8ces et billets se c\u00f4toient ainsi dans une fresque th\u00e9matique et chronologique qui fera voyager le visiteur dans le temps et \u00e0 travers le monde.\r\n\r\nEnfin, le dernier circuit regroupe une s\u00e9rie d\u2019objets qui d\u00e9montre \u00e0 quel point l\u2019argent est pr\u00e9sent dans notre quotidien.\r\n\r\nLes visites de groupe sont organis\u00e9es \u00e0 partir de 10 personnes - maximum 25. Elles sont gratuites et durent environ 1 heure. Les r\u00e9servations se font via le formulaire en ligne disponible sur le site internet http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/fr\/booking. \r\nRenseignements : 02 221 22 06 \u2013 museum@nbb.be","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Warmoesberg","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Warmoesberg, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 2018 is het museum van de Nationale Bank van Belgi\u00eb in een prachtig 19de-eeuwse bankgebouw ondergebracht.\r\n\r\nAan de hand van interactieve opstellingen focust een eerste parcours in het museum op de taken van een centrale bank. Met behulp van een audiogids kan de bezoeker meer te weten komen over de uitgifte van munten en biljetten, zijn of haar kennis van de euro testen of proberen de inflatie onder controle te houden.\r\nHet tweede parcours schetst de evolutie van de betaalmiddelen en zet hierbij de collecties van het museum in de kijker. Goederengeld, oude ruilmiddelen, munten en biljetten vormen een thematisch en chronologisch geheel, waarbij de bezoeker wordt meegenomen op een reis in de tijd en over heel de wereld.\r\nHet derde parcours tenslotte toont een aantal voorwerpen waarmee wordt aangetoond hoe sterk geld aanwezig is in ons dagelijkse leven.\r\n\r\nGroepsbezoeken kunnen vanaf 10 personen, maximum 25. Ze zijn gratis en duren ongeveer 1 uur. Reserveren graag via de website van het museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/nl\/booking.\r\nMeer informatie: tel 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Museum of the National Bank of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since 2018 the museum of the National Bank of Belgium is housed in a splendid 19t century bank building situates at a mere 10-minute walk from the Central Station.\r\n\r\nThe first part of the exhibition pays particular attention to the role and the functions of the National Bank. By use of an audio guide and interactive displays, the visitor will no doubt discover lots of interesting facts about the issue of notes and coins, test their knowledge of the euro, or even try to control the rate of inflation.\r\n\r\nThe second part paints an overall picture of the evolution of money, and showcases many wonderful objects from the museum collection. Commodity money, diverse and peculiar objects once used for bartering, coins and notes... These many various pieces are purposely put in a thematical and chronological context which in the end will provide the visitor with a fascinating overview.\r\n\r\nThe third part of the exhibition proves just how much money is present in our day to day life by displaying a wide range of objects, some everyday and trivial, some quirky.\r\n\r\nGroup visits can be from 10 people up to 25. They are free and take about 1 hour. Please book via the website of the museum https:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be\/en\/booking.\r\nMore information: 02 221 22 06 - museum@nbb.be ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res","address_street_number":"57","address_street_box":null,"email":"museum@nbb.be","website":"http:\/\/www.nbbmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 221 22 06","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u00e8res, 57","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Banque Nationale de Belgique","address_street_name":"rue Montagne aux Herbes potag\u