sizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,27],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Photographie"],"nl":["Galeries","Fotografie"],"en":["Art Galleries","Photography"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Fotografie"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Fotografia"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Fotograf\u00eda"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en","de"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"L'ann\u00e9e de la r\u00e9silience. Exposition de photos organis\u00e9e avec l'Ambassade d'Ukraine","shortdescr":"The Year of Resilience. Courage, determination and solidarity est une exposition photographique pr\u00e9par\u00e9e par la Galerie d'Art Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska \u00e0 Bruxelles au Mont des Arts 8 en coop\u00e9ration avec l'Ambassade d'Ukraine au Royaume de Belgique.","longdescr":"L'exposition pr\u00e9sentera plusieurs dizaines de photographies documentant la r\u00e9sistance h\u00e9ro\u00efque de l'Ukraine attaqu\u00e9e dans la guerre par l'agresseur russe. L`exposition consiste des photographies prises par des photographes de guerre actifs dans toute l'Ukraine. De plus, il y a aussi des photographies prises par d'autres personnes - qui sont des t\u00e9moignages concrets de la cruaut\u00e9 des troupes russes, du courage et de la d\u00e9termination des d\u00e9fenseurs ukrainiens et de la solidarit\u00e9 exprim\u00e9e \u00e0 divers niveaux, par diverses personnes, communaut\u00e9s et pays.\r\n\r\nL'exposition est une contribution \u00e0 la r\u00e9flexion sur la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 de la guerre et l'ampleur des d\u00e9fis auxquels la nation ukrainienne est confront\u00e9e au quotidien. En m\u00eame temps, cependant, la documentation photograpique permit de puiser \u00e0 la source de l'espoir de victoire dans la guerre contre la barbarie.\r\n\r\nGalerie d'art Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska,\r\nMont des Arts 8 Bruxelles\r\nOuverture: 15.02.2023 a 18.00h :\r\nExposition ( formule vitres 7\/7 ) 16.02-22.02.2023","performers":"Ambassade d'Ukraine dans le Royaume de Belgique\r\nJustyna Napiorkowska, PhD","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 71 89 88","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551592"},"nl":{"name":"The Year of Resilience. Exposition de photos organis\u00e9e avec l'Ambassade d'Ukraine","shortdescr":"The Year of Resilience. Courage, determination and solidarity is a photography exhibition hosted by the Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska Art Gallery in Brussels at Mont des Arts 8. The exhibition is organised in cooperation with the Embassy of Ukraine in the Kingdom of Belgium.","longdescr":"The exhibition will feature photographs documenting the heroic resistance of Ukraine attacked by Russia. It includes photographs taken by war photographers active throughout Ukraine. In addition, photographs of civilians are also presented, to serve as concrete testimonies to the cruelty of the Russian troops, the courage and determination of the Ukrainian defenders, and the solidarity expressed at various levels, by various people, communities and countries.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition is a contribution to reflection on the reality of war and the scale of challenges faced by the Ukrainian nation every day. At the same time, however, it allows you to draw from the source of hope for victory in the war against the barbarism of the Russian aggressor.\r\n\r\nGallery Katarzyna Napiorkowska\r\nBrussels Mont des Arts 8\r\n\r\nOpening: 15.02.2023 at 6 pm\r\nExhibition: 16.02-22.02.2023 ( windows only 7\/7)","performers":"Embassy of Ukraine in the Kingdom of Belgium \r\nJustyna Napiorkowska, PhD","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551592"},"en":{"name":"The Year of Resilience. Exposition de photos organis\u00e9e avec l'Ambassade d'Ukraine","shortdescr":"The Year of Resilience. Courage, determination and solidarity is a photography exhibition hosted by the Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska Art Gallery in Brussels at Mont des Arts 8. The exhibition is organised in cooperation with the Embassy of Ukraine in the Kingdom of Belgium.","longdescr":"The exhibition will feature photographs documenting the heroic resistance of Ukraine attacked by Russia. It includes photographs taken by war photographers active throughout Ukraine. In addition, photographs of civilians are also presented, to serve as concrete testimonies to the cruelty of the Russian troops, the courage and determination of the Ukrainian defenders, and the solidarity expressed at various levels, by various people, communities and countries.\r\n\r\nThe exhibition is a contribution to reflection on the reality of war and the scale of challenges faced by the Ukrainian nation every day. At the same time, however, it allows you to draw from the source of hope for victory in the war against the barbarism of the Russian aggressor.\r\n\r\nGallery Katarzyna Napiorkowska\r\nBrussels Mont des Arts 8\r\n\r\nOpening: 15.02.2023 at 6 pm\r\nExhibition: 16.02-22.02.2023 ( windows only 7\/7)","performers":"Embassy of Ukraine in the Kingdom of Belgium \r\nJustyna Napiorkowska, PhD","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551592"},"de":{"name":"The Year of Resilience. \/ L'ann\u00e9e de la r\u00e9silience. Exposition de photos organis\u00e9e avec l'Ambassade d'Ukraine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551592"},"it":{"name":"The Year of Resilience. \/ L'ann\u00e9e de la r\u00e9silience. Exposition de phot