,"shortdescr":"Apr\u00e8s nous avoir surpris avec Un Tailleur pour dames, Georges Lini s\u2019empare de La Vraie Vie, premier roman coup de poing de l\u2019auteure belge Adeline Dieudonn\u00e9. Gratifi\u00e9 de nombreux prix litt\u00e9raires, le r\u00e9cit est port\u00e9 \u00e0 la sc\u00e8ne par un solide duo de com\u00e9diens et la romanci\u00e8re elle-m\u00eame dans le r\u00f4le de la narratrice.","longdescr":"Une cage en verre : la maison familiale. Une cuisine, un salon, une t\u00e9l\u00e9, des bouteilles de whisky\u2026 Les p\u00eaches au thon de la m\u00e8re et les troph\u00e9es de chasse du p\u00e8re\u2026 C\u2019est comme une maison magique, celle des souvenirs d\u2019enfance. Dedans, il y a la famille : l\u2019ogre de p\u00e8re, la craintive de m\u00e8re, le petit fr\u00e8re qu\u2019il faut sortir des griffes du monstre. Dehors, il y a la narratrice de 10 ans, la s\u0153ur qui, de temps \u00e0 autre, plonge dans ses souvenirs \u00e0 moins que ce ne soient eux qui la rattrapent. Pass\u00e9 et pr\u00e9sent finissent par se m\u00ealer alors qu\u2019elle voudrait effacer cette vie qui lui appara\u00eet comme le brouillon de l\u2019autre. La vraie !","performers":"De et avec : Adeline Dieudonn\u00e9 \r\nAvec : Georges Lini, Isabelle Defoss\u00e9 Et un jeune, en alternance Amos Suchecki, Louis Fayt, Octave Delaunoy \r\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : Georges Lini","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"nl":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"en":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"de":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"it":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"sp":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"pt":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"},"cn":{"name":"La vraie vie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550849"}},"place":{"id":243359,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak, 1","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","descr