gendliche 15-18 Jahre","Senioren","LGTBQIA"],"it":["Insegnanti","Famiglie","Ragazzi 12-15 anni","Ragazzi 15-18 anni","Anziani","LGTBQIA"],"sp":["Profesores","Familias","J\u00f3venes de 12 a 15 a\u00f1os","J\u00f3venes de 15 a 18 a\u00f1os","Personas de la tercera edad","LGTBQIA"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,257,258,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Appareils d'amplification du son","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Geluidsversterkende apparatuur","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Sound-amplifying equipment","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","H\u00f6rverst\u00e4rker","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Apparecchi acustici","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Aparatos de amplificaci\u00f3n del sonido","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-11T08:06:37+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-02T14:49:35+01:00","backoffice_id":270849,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":550861,"date_start":"2023-02-23","date_end":"2023-02-23","date_next":"2023-02-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"fr":"Animations","nl":"Animaties","en":"Animations","de":"Animationen","it":"Animazioni","sp":"Animaciones","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[95],"translations":{"fr":["Patrimoine"],"nl":["Erfgoed"],"en":["Heritage"],"de":["Kulturerbe"],"it":["Patrimonio culturale"],"sp":["Patrimonio"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":"Descendez sous la place Royale \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des vestiges de l\u2019ancien palais de Charles Quint et menez l\u2019enqu\u00eate dans une \u00ab Murder Party \u00bb haletante.","longdescr":"Un jeu d\u2019enqu\u00eate \u00e0 mener dans les vestiges de l\u2019ancien palais de Bruxelles. L\u2019objectif ? R\u00e9soudre un \u00ab cold case \u00bb de pr\u00e8s de 500 ans\r\n\r\nBruxelles, 1521. Alors qu\u2019une f\u00eate bat son plein au palais, un personnage important d\u00e9c\u00e8de dans des circonstances \u00e9tranges. Quelques si\u00e8cles plus tard, son fant\u00f4me et celui de plusieurs convives r\u00e9apparaissent sur les lieux m\u00eame du crime. Alert\u00e9s par la pr\u00e9sence de ces \u00e2mes perdues, les gardiens du mus\u00e9e demandent aux visiteurs de d\u00e9couvrir la cl\u00e9 de ce myst\u00e8re ; pour y parvenir, il vous faudra d\u00e9passer votre peur et interroger les t\u00e9moins du drame.\r\n\r\nDescendez sous la place Royale \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des vestiges de l\u2019ancien palais de Charles Quint et menez l\u2019enqu\u00eate dans une \u00ab Murder Party \u00bb haletante.\r\n\r\nComment \u00e7a se passe ?\r\n\r\nAvec votre smartphone (ou votre tablette), rassemblez les indices r\u00e9partis dans le site arch\u00e9ologique. A l\u2019aide de QR codes et de vid\u00e9os, recueillez le t\u00e9moignage de chaque personnage de l\u2019histoire pour r\u00e9soudre l\u2019\u00e9nigme. Le ma\u00eetre du jeu vous aidera \u00e0 pr\u00e9ciser votre hypoth\u00e8se et \u00e0 percer le myst\u00e8re.\r\n\r\nInformations pratiques :\r\n\r\nQuand : mercredi 28 d\u00e9cembre 2022 de 17:30 \u00e0 22:00\r\n\r\nTarifs : 15\u20ac-12\u20ac (-26 ans)\r\n\r\nEntr\u00e9e : Place Royale 10 \u2013 1000 Bruxelles\r\n\r\nInfos : www.coudenberg.brussels ou + 32 (0)2 563 61 79\r\n\r\nLangues : fran\u00e7ais, n\u00e9erlandais, anglais\r\n\r\nPublic : \u00e0 partir de 15 ans\r\n\r\nTickets : https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=coudenberg&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=251FE5BF-C551-F738-DD4A-49776D14F72F&lg=FR","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=coudenberg&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=251FE5BF-C551-F738-DD4A-49776D14F72F&lg=FR","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"nl":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":"Daal af in de gewelven onder het Koningsplein, ontdek de overblijfselen van het voormalig paleis van Keizer Karel en voer het onderzoek in een adembenemende \u201c Murder Party\u201d.","longdescr":"Een detectivespel dat gespeeld wordt in de overblijfselen van het oude paleis van Brussel. Het doel? Een \u201ccold case\u201d van 500 jaar oud oplossen\r\n\r\nBrussel, 1521, terwijl een feest volop aan de gang is in het paleis, overlijdt een belangrijk personage in donkere omstandigheden. Enkele eeuwen later verschijnt zijn geest samen met die van enkele medegenodigden opnieuw op de plaats van het delict. De museumbewakers worden opgeschrikt door de aanwezigheid van deze verloren zielen en vragen aan de bezoekers om het mysterie te ontrafelen.\r\n\r\nDaal af in de gewelven onder het Koningsplein, ontdek de overblijfselen van het voormalig paleis van Keizer Karel en voer het onderzoek in een adembenemende \u201c Murder Party\u201d.\r\n\r\nHoe werkt het?\r\n\r\nNeem je smartphone of tablet en zoek de aanwijzingen die verstopt zijn in de archeologische site. Bekijk met behulp van QR codes de video\u2019s met het verhaal van alle getuigen om het mysterie op te lossen. De spelmeester helpt je om jouw hypothese te verfijnen en het mysterie te ontrafelen.\r\n\r\nPraktische info:\r\n\r\nWanneer : woensdag 28 december 2022 van 17:30 tot 22:00\r\n\r\nTarief : 12\u20ac (-26 ans) -15\u20ac\r\n\r\nIngang : Koningsplein 10 \u2013 1000 Brussel\r\n\r\nInfo : www.coudenberg.brussels of + 32 (0)2 563 61 79\r\n\r\nTalen : Nederlands, Frans en Engels\r\n\r\nDoelgroep : vanaf 15 jaar\r\n\r\nTickets: https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=coudenberg&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=251FE5BF-C551-F738-DD4A-49776D14F72F&lg=NL","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=coudenberg&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=251FE5BF-C551-F738-DD4A-49776D14F72F&lg=NL","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"en":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":"Go down under the Place Royale to discover the remains of Charles V's former palace and investigate in a thrilling Murder Party.","longdescr":"An investigation game to play in the remains of the former Palace of Brussels. The goal? Solve a 500-year-old cold case\r\n\r\nBrussels, 1521. During festivities at Coudenberg Palace, an important person dies in strange circumstances. Centuries later, his ghost and that of fellow guests now haunt the remains of the palace. Startled by the presence of these lost souls, the museum's guardians ask visitors to discover the key to this mystery. To do so, you will have to overcome your fear and interview the witnesses to the drama.\r\n\r\nGo down under the Place Royale to discover the remains of Charles V's former palace and investigate in a thrilling Murder Party.\r\n\r\nHow does it work?\r\n\r\nUse your smartphone (or tablet) to collect clues spread around the archaeological site. Using QR codes and videos, listen to the testimony of each character in the story to solve the enigma. The game master will help you to clarify your hypothesis and solve the mystery.\r\n\r\nPractical information\r\n\r\nWhen: Wednesday 28th of December 2022 from 17:30 to 22:00\r\n\r\nPrices: 15\u20ac -12\u20ac (-26 years old)\r\n\r\nEntrance: Place Royale 10 - 1000 Brussels\r\n\r\nInfo: www.coudenberg.brussels or + 32 (0)2 563 61 79\r\n\r\nLanguages: French, Dutch, English\r\n\r\nPublic: from 15 years old\r\n\r\nTickets: https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=coudenberg&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=251FE5BF-C551-F738-DD4A-49776D14F72F&lg=EN","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=coudenberg&module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&s=251FE5BF-C551-F738-DD4A-49776D14F72F&lg=EN","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"de":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"it":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"sp":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"pt":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"},"cn":{"name":"Murder Mystery Game","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550861"}},"place":{"id":258195,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los <b>vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg<\/b>, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una <b>exposici\u00f3n permanente<\/b> de objetos hallados durante las distintas <b>excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas<\/b> realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","descrip