 de Bruxelles. \r\n\u00c0 l\u2019occasion du brassin public, le service du Tourisme vous invite \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir la \r\ntransformation du froment, de l\u2019orge malt\u00e9 et du houblon surann\u00e9 selon la m\u00e9thode \r\nutilis\u00e9e depuis des d\u00e9cennies par ces artisans brasseurs.\r\nUne d\u00e9gustation est comprise dans le prix de la visite.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 51","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"nl":{"name":"Bezoek aan brouwerij  Cantillon + degustatie","shortdescr":"Brouwerij Cantillon, ontstaan in 1900, is een van de oudste van Brussel.\r\nTer gelegenheid van de Open Brouwdag nodigt de dienst Toerisme u uit om de \r\ntransformatie van tarwe, gemoute gerst en overjaarse hop te ontdekken volgens de \r\nmethode die al decennia lang door deze ambachtelijke brouwers wordt toegepast.\r\nBij de prijs van het bezoek is een degustatie inbegrepen.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"toerisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"en":{"name":"Visite de la Brasserie  Cantillon + d\u00e9gustation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"de":{"name":"Visite de la Brasserie  Cantillon + d\u00e9gustation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"it":{"name":"Visite de la Brasserie  Cantillon + d\u00e9gustation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"sp":{"name":"Visite de la Brasserie  Cantillon + d\u00e9gustation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"pt":{"name":"Visite de la Brasserie  Cantillon + d\u00e9gustation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"},"cn":{"name":"Visite de la Brasserie  Cantillon + d\u00e9gustation","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550577"}},"place":{"id":235618,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Brasserie Cantillon - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de la Gueuze","address_street_name":"Rue Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Perdu dans un quartier moins touristique, le Mus\u00e9e bruxellois de la Gueuze pr\u00e9sente un patrimoine \"vivant\" car toujours en activit\u00e9, dans son contexte technique, \u00e9conomique et historique. D'octobre \u00e0 fin mars, \u00e0 la brasserie \"Cantillon\", on peut assister aux diverses \u00e9tapes de la fabrication de la gueuze et du lambic. Le public parcourra avec plaisir les diff\u00e9rentes salles : salle de brassage, salle des cuves de cuisson, greniers \u00e0 grains, bac refroidissoir, salle de futailles des tonneaux, lieu d'assemblage, lieu de nettoyage des f\u00fbts, bloc d'embouteillage et enfin, la cave.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Brouwerij Cantillon - Brussels Museum van de Geuze","address_street_name":"Gheudestraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Gheudestraat","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"In een minder toeristische buurt stelt het Brussels Museum van de Geuze een \"levend\" erfgoed voor, in zijn technische, economische en historische context. Van oktober tot eind maart kan men in deze actieve brouwerij \"Cantillon\" in levende lijve de verschillende fasen van het brouwen van geuze en lambic meemaken. Aan de bezoekers worden de verschillende stadia uitgelegd aan de hand van de opeenvolgende ruimtes: de brouwerszaal, de zaal met de gistkuipen, de graanzolders, de koelbakken, de opslagplaats voor de houten vaten, de werkplaats voor het op fles trekken en natuurlijk de kelder voor het bewaren van de flessen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cantillon Brewery - Brussels Museum of the Gueuze","address_street_name":"R. Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"R. Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"This family brewery where Lambic, Gueuze, Faro and Kriek are made and where nothing has changed since 1900 when it was founded, welcomes you and invites you to discover a fabulous world. Beers, tools and brewing process are still the same as in the beginning. Red copper containers, barrels, some of them more than 100 years old, and walls of bottles constitute the scenery for your visit.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Brauerei Cantillon - Br\u00fcsseler Gueuze-Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Gheude","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cantillon.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cantillon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 521 49 28","phone_booking":"+32 2 520 28 91","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue Gheude","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Brauerei Cantillon - belgisches Bier mit Michelin-Stern! Die Brauerei Cantillon ist die einzige noch aktive Brauerei in Br\u00fcssel, die f\u00fcr die \u00d6ffentlichkeit zug\u00e4nglich ist. \r\nVerborgen in einem etwas weniger touristischen Viertel betreibt die Brauerei Cantillon seit 1978 auch das Br\u00fcsseler Gueuze-Museum, das die Besonderheiten der spontang\u00e4rigen belgischen Biere Gueze, Lambic und artverwandten Biere in Szene setzt.  \r\n\r\nVon Oktober bis Ende M\u00e4rz kann man den Braumeistern der Brauerei Cantillon bei ihrer Arbeit \u00fcber die Schulter blicken und die verschiedenen Etappen des Brauprozesses verfolgen: Vom Brausaal \u00fcber den Kesselsaal, den Kornspeicher, das K\u00fchlbecken, die unterschiedlichen Etappen der Bierf\u00e4sser, die Abf\u00fcllung und bis hin zum Keller.\r\n\r\nDie Brauerei, in der Braumeister Jean-Pierre van Roy die Familientradition fortsetzt, darf sich sogar mit einem Stern des Gourmetf\u00fchrers Michelin schm\u00fccken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Brasserie Cantillo