i, sauce alg\u00e9rienne (TDM 183 #34 Alg\u00e9rie)","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Soir\u00e9e cha\u00e2bi, sauce alg\u00e9rienne (TDM 183 #34 Alg\u00e9rie)","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Soir\u00e9e cha\u00e2bi, sauce alg\u00e9rienne (TDM 183 #34 Alg\u00e9rie)","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Soir\u00e9e cha\u00e2bi, sauce alg\u00e9rienne (TDM 183 #34 Alg\u00e9rie)","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Soir\u00e9e cha\u00e2bi, sauce alg\u00e9rienne (TDM 183 #34 Alg\u00e9rie)","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-02-25","doors":"18:00:00","start":"19:00:00","end":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible"],"nl":["Toegankelijk"],"en":["Accessible"],"de":["Barrierefrei"],"it":["Accessibile"],"sp":["Habilitado"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-11T07:36:37+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-09T08:40:51+01:00","backoffice_id":271281,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":550888,"date_start":"2023-02-25","date_end":"2023-02-26","date_next":"2023-02-25","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":57,"translations":{"fr":"Clubbing","nl":"Clubbing","en":"Clubbing","de":"Clubbing","it":"Locali notturni","sp":"Ir de discoteca","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":"NITE","longdescr":"\u24b8\u2460\u2461\r\nBjarki\r\nKeyser\r\nData Canem\r\n\u24b8\u2460\u2460 Brussels Bassed\r\nMartyn\r\nBeatsforbeaches & Nayrah\r\nNidrev\r\n\r\nGood to know\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nDoors open: 23h\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAge limit : + 21\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nIn = In \/\/ Out = Out\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nFor all kinds of people.\r\n\r\nTickets\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nLimited amount of presale tickets : https:\/\/c12space.com\/presale-tickets\/\r\nDoor sale starts at 23h.\r\nLockers : 2\u20ac\r\nToilets : Free\r\n\r\nAddress\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\n116 rue marche aux herbes\r\n1000 Brussels\r\n\r\n\ufeff\r\nWhat we stand for\r\n\u2594\u2594\u2594\r\nC12 is a pluridisciplinary space where art & clubbing collide. It\u2019s a place where freedom, diversity, creativity and alternative cultures are protected from the outside world and its norms and restrictions. By doing this, we wish to establish a place owned by artists, musicians and every individual who comes through our door.\r\n\r\nNO!\r\n\u2014\u2014-\r\nIn order to protect our space, we will not tolerate any discriminating comportment (racism, sexism, homophobia, \u2026), shaming, violence, consumption of drugs and any kind of intrusive behaviour, even in its most passive form.\r\n\r\nRESPECT!\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014-\r\nBetween these walls, we look out for each other and respect and tolerance are key. Everyone among us is treated equally, regardless of who they are, where they come from and what they do. The space belongs to everyone and to no group or no community in particular.\r\n\r\nIN OR NOT?\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014-\r\nC12 is a private space and reserves the right to decide which visitors are allowed to enter. Represented by our door staff, we reserve the right to deny entry to every person deemed unable to respect the values connected to the project.\r\n\r\nNEED HELP?\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014-\r\nC12\u2019s staff has been trained to act against any disputative situation or behavior. We have a help desk located near the entrance of the main room, where you can talk to a staff member any time of the night. We have staff present on the dance floor and in every corner of the club, functioning as our eyes and ears. We encourage anyone who witnesses a violation of the rules to contact a C12 staff member. In case of indictment, C12 reserves the right to contact the authorities. Respect yourself, the audience, the artists and the staff, stay hydrated and have a pleasant time.\r\nWe wish you an incredible night of clubbing.","performers":"C12\r\nBjarki \r\nKeyser\r\nData Canem\r\n\r\n\r\nC11 : Brussels Bassed \r\nMartyn\r\nBeatsforbeaches &  Nayrah\r\nNidrev","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 86 59 12","phone_booking":"+32 471 86 59 12","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"nl":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"en":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"de":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"it":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"sp":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"pt":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"},"cn":{"name":"NITE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/c12space.com","email":"c12brussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550888"}},"place":{"id":258273,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Deep in House","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.deepinhouse.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Deep in House","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\u00ab Deep in House \u00bb est un collectif cr\u00e9\u00e9 en juin 2012 et compos\u00e9 de quatre jeunes d'une vingtaine d'ann\u00e9es. Leur objectif \u00e9tait de partager leur amour en commun : celui de la \u00ab House music \u00bb \u00e0 ses origines - c'est-\u00e0-dire dans les ann\u00e9es 80 aux Etats-Unis - mais \u00e9galement les diff\u00e9rentes variantes qui en sont issues.\r\n\r\nL'id\u00e9e de ce projet leur est venue de leurs exp\u00e9riences personnelles respecti... Afficher la suite","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Deep in House","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.deepinhouse.be\/","phone_contact":null,"p