ra Matthys (la cheffe Lo) est bioing\u00e9nieure, cuisini\u00e8re et com\u00e9dienne. Elle s\u2019entoure de com\u00e9dien\u00b7nes professionnel\u00b7les pour donner un spectacle \u00e9ducatif amusant et percutant.\r\n\r\nLa Cheffe Lo et ses acolytes pr\u00e9sentent aux enfants des l\u00e9gumes rigolos et racontent des histoires incroyables \u00e0 leur sujet ! De courts extraits vid\u00e9os sont projet\u00e9s sur un \u00e9cran pour d\u00e9couvrir la culture des l\u00e9gumes en Belgique.\r\nLes enfants sont invit\u00e9s \u00e0 amener un l\u00e9gume de leur choix pour inspirer les impros.","performers":"Laura Matthys, M\u00e9lissa Motheu, Agathe Mortelecq, Renaud Leclercq, Thierry Maerschalk","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/On-se-poele.html","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539462"},"nl":{"name":"On se po\u00eale !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/On-se-poele.html","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539462"},"en":{"name":"On se po\u00eale !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/On-se-poele.html","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539462"},"de":{"name":"On se po\u00eale !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/On-se-poele.html","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539462"},"it":{"name":"On se po\u00eale !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url"