schwierigkeiten","Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr blinde und sehbehinderte Menschen","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Assistenzhund","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non vedenti e ipovedenti","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Cane guida","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-13T02:35:13+01:00","published_at":"2022-10-06T12:49:27+02:00","backoffice_id":263605,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.37641441155241},{"id":547247,"date_start":"2023-01-19","date_end":"2023-02-25","date_next":"2023-02-14","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,34],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Galeries","Pluridisciplinair"],"en":["Art Galleries","Multidisciplinary"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Multidisziplin\u00e4r"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Multidisciplinare"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Multidisciplinar"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Bernard Villers - 'Tout est l\u00e0'","shortdescr":"Nous avons le plaisir d\u2019annoncer l\u2019ouverture de \u00ab Tout est l\u00e0 \u00bb, deuxi\u00e8me exposition personnelle de l\u2019artiste historique Bernard Villers \u00e0 la galerie Ir\u00e8ne Laub.","longdescr":"A la fois rigoureuse et poe\u0301tique, la pratique artistique de Bernard Villers questionne la relation traditionnelle entre le support et la couleur, re\u0301ve\u0301lant une ve\u0301ritable interaction et multipliant les dialogues entre ces deux e\u0301le\u0301ments essentiels. Les mate\u0301riaux sont de\u0301libe\u0301re\u0301ments choisis pour les caractristiques qui leur sont propres, les gestes sont clairs et peu nombreux, les choix sont sans compromis. Il de\u0301tourne les attentes du spectateur en proposant des de\u0301constructions ou des interventions chromatiques directes et minimales, mais empreintes d\u2019une de\u0301licate e\u0301motion : la beaute\u0301 du quotidien se re\u0301ve\u0300le dans les de\u0301licates imperfections des lignes trace\u0301es par l\u2019artiste. \r\nApre\u0300s une formation en peinture monumentale a\u0300 l\u2019E\u0301cole nationale supe\u0301rieure des Arts visuels de La Cambre avec Paul Delvaux et Jo Delahaut, Bernard Villers de\u0301veloppe ses recherches picturales et devient une figure majeure de la sce\u0300ne artistique belge. Son approche sensible et innovante a e\u0301te\u0301 ce\u0301le\u0301bre\u0301e par une exposition re\u0301trospective au centre d\u2019art Le Botanique (Bruxelles, BE) en 2018. \r\nSes \u0153uvres sont notamment pre\u0301sentes dans les collections du FRAC Bretagne, Rennes (FR), Bibliothe\u0300que Nationale de France, Paris (FR), Muse\u0301es Royaux des Beaux-Arts, Bruxelles (BE), Centre de la Gravure, La Louvie\u0300re (BE), Fondation Gordon Matta-Clark, Anvers (BE), Collection FWB, Bruxelles (BE), Muse\u0301e d\u2019Ixelles, Bruxelles (BE), Muse\u0301e royal de Mariemont, Morlanwelz (BE), Serralves, Porto (PT) et Werserburg Museum, Bremen (DE).","performers":"Bernard Villers (BE)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 647 55 16","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547247"},"nl":{"name":"Bernard Villers - 'Tout est l\u00e0'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547247"},"en":{"name":"Bernard Villers - 'Tout est l\u00e0'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547247"},"de":{"name":"Bernard Villers - 'Tout est l\u00e0'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547247"},"it":{"name":"Bernard Villers - 'Tout est l\u00e0'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547247"},"sp":{"name":"Bernard Villers - 'Tout est l\u00e0'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_b