ns":{"fr":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":"La galerie Ali\u00e9nor Prouvost est fi\u00e8re et heureuse de pr\u00e9senter pour la premi\u00e8re fois a\u0300 Bruxelles, du 12 janvier au 25 f\u00e9vrier 2023, ORDINARY LIFE, un magnifique ensemble d\u2019\u0153uvres sur toile et de papiers de l\u2019artiste chinoise LIN WENJIE.","longdescr":"L\u2019artiste explore la peinture figurative et nous d\u00e9voile des moments ordinaires de vie via son prisme color\u00e9 et optimiste. \u00c0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019une photographe, elle va saisir sur toile des personnages et une atmosph\u00e8re qui la touche. Un jeu de miroir est \u00e9tabli o\u00f9 observer le tableau nous renvoie \u00e9trangement \u00e0 notre propre image. Elle consid\u00e8re ses \u0153uvres comme \u00ab concr\u00e8tes, directes, visuelles, voire tactiles \u00bb. Son souhait est de donner de la force et de l\u2019\u00e9nergie \u00e0 celui qui regarde sa peinture. Le pari est gagn\u00e9 pour notre part !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 347 18 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"nl":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"en":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":"The Ali\u00e9nor Prouvost gallery is proud and happy to present for the first time in Brussels, from January 12th to February 25th 2023, ORDINARY LIFE, a magnificent exhibition of canvases and papers by Chinese artist LIN WENJIE.","longdescr":"The artist Lin Wenjie explores figurative painting and reveals us ordinary moments of life through her colorful and optimistic prism. Like a photographer, she captures on the canvas, characters and an atmosphere that moves her. A mirror effects is established and observing the painting strangely returns us to our own image. She considers her works as \u00abconcrete, direct, visual, even tactile\u00bb. Her wish is to give strength and energy to those who look at her painting. For us, the bet is won !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"de":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"it":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"sp":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"pt":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"},"cn":{"name":"LIN WENJIE - Ordinary Life","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548458"}},"place":{"id":276427,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Galerie Alienor Prouvost","address_street_name":"Rue Washington","address_street_number":"64","address_street_box":null,"email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 347 18 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Washington, 64","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Apr\u00e8s quelques ann\u00e9es \u00e0 travailler dans l\u2019art moderne \u00e0 Paris, Ali\u00e9nor Prouvost d\u00e9cide de r\u00e9aliser son r\u00eave et de fonder sa galerie au c\u0153ur de la capitale europ\u00e9enne. En mars 2019, elle ouvre les portes du 64, rue Washington dans le quartier du Ch\u00e2telain.\r\n\r\nLa galerie Ali\u00e9nor Prouvost explore principalement les mouvements de l\u2019apr\u00e8s-guerre mais s\u2019int\u00e9resse aussi beaucoup \u00e0 l\u2019Art contemporain.\r\nElle a pour but de d\u00e9mocratiser l\u2019Art, le diffuser et le rendre accessible aupr\u00e8s du plus grand nombre. Elle pr\u00e9sente ainsi, pour les artistes d\u2019apr\u00e8s-guerre, souvent des \u0153uvres sur papier pour permettre aux jeunes collectionneurs de retrouver d\u2019une exposition \u00e0 l\u2019autre les m\u00eames gammes de prix ; de 25 euros \u00e0 15 000 euros. Pour les artistes d\u00e9j\u00e0 tr\u00e8s c\u00f4t\u00e9s, elle travaille \u00e9galement en courtage et essaye de rechercher pour vous l\u2019\u0153uvre la plus proche de vos souhaits.\r\n\r\nLa galerie collabore uniquement en direct avec les artistes, les ayants droit d\u2019artistes ou des fondations pour proposer un contenu toujours exclusif et unique. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ces partenariats, la galerie s\u2019engage sur le long terme \u00e0 contribuer au rayonnement de leurs \u0153uvres. Attach\u00e9e \u00e0 une vision actuelle de son r\u00f4le, elle participe \u00e0 repenser l\u2019histoire de l\u2019art, aiguiser les regards \u2013 et ce \u00e0 destination de tous et toutes.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Galerie Alienor Prouvost","address_street_name":"Rue Washington","address_street_number":"64","address_street_box":null,"email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 347 18 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Rue Washington, 64","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Galerie Alienor Prouvost","address_street_name":"Rue Washington","address_street_number":"64","address_street_box":null,"email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 347 18 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Washington, 64","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Galerie Alienor Prouvost","address_street_name":"Rue Washington","address_street_number":"64","address_street_box":null,"email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 347 18 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Washington, 64","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Galerie Alienor Prouvost","address_street_name":"Rue Washington","address_street_number":"64","address_street_box":null,"email":"ap@alienorprouvost.com","website":"http:\/\/www.alienorprouvost.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 3