T09:35:17+01:00","published_at":"2023-01-20T15:48:53+01:00","backoffice_id":270083,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":550789,"date_start":"2023-02-11","date_end":"2023-02-16","date_next":"2023-02-16","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":"Esposizioni","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[24,29],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Installation"],"nl":["Galeries","Installatiekunst"],"en":["Art Galleries","Installation"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Installation"],"it":["Gallerie d'arte","Installazioni"],"sp":["Galer\u00edas de arte","Instalaci\u00f3n"],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Spectacles d'Art en Direct\u00a0: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise","shortdescr":"Interactive Light Show de l'artiste japonaise Yuiko R\u00e1yka. Les visiteurs sont invit\u00e9s \u00e0 projeter et cr\u00e9er leurs propres exp\u00e9riences lumineuses dans notre galerie. \r\nPeinture \u00e0 l'encre en direct du ma\u00eetre peintre japonais Keisuke Watanabe, accompagn\u00e9 d'un mod\u00e8le et de la musique","longdescr":"\u2022 Keisuke Watanabe vit et travaille \u00e0 Kyoto, au Japon.\r\nUn ma\u00eetre dessinateur est bien connu pour ses dessins \u00e0 l'encre qui cherchent \u00e0 d\u00e9peindre l'\u00e9nergie de ses mod\u00e8les \u00e0 travers des mouvements corporels dynamiques. Musicien professionnel, Watanabe per\u00e7oit la peinture \u00e0 travers son exp\u00e9rience musicale. Son art na\u00eet de la musique classique et se d\u00e9veloppe sous son influence constante. Son d\u00e9sir d'explorer les diff\u00e9rents \u00e9tats du corps humain en mouvement, son attrait sensuel est satisfait par des croquis improvis\u00e9s sur le vif.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Yuiko R\u00e1yka vit et travaille \u00e0 Kyoto, au Japon.\r\nL'\u0153uvre lumineuse est une installation interactive et cr\u00e9able que les spectateurs peuvent cr\u00e9er eux-m\u00eames. Le spectateur utilise une lampe de poche pour faire briller la lumi\u00e8re sur les mat\u00e9riaux r\u00e9fl\u00e9chissants install\u00e9s dans la salle d'exposition, et les reflets illusoires sont projet\u00e9s sur les murs. Cette action et ce ph\u00e9nom\u00e8ne sont appel\u00e9s \"Selfverse\" dans ce travail. Le \"Selfverse\" est le propre monde de possibilit\u00e9s infinies du spectateur.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Art Y\u012b est une galerie d'art contemporain situ\u00e9e aux Monts-des-Arts, \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Gare Centrale et \u00e0 100m de la Grand Place. La galerie offre une fusion unique d'art contemporain universel. Un large \u00e9ventail de sculptures et de peintures d'artistes internationaux est pr\u00e9sent\u00e9.\r\n\r\nPour plus d'information: https:\/\/www.art-yi.com\/viewing-room\/20-music-is-selfverse-exclusive-japanese-live-painting-and-light-shows\/","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.art-yi.com","email":"info@art-yi.com","phone_contact":"+32 474 70 04 07","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550789"},"nl":{"name":"Live kunstshows: lichtkunst en Japanse schilderkunst","shortdescr":"Interactieve lichtshow van de Japanse kunstenaar Yuiko R\u00e1yka. Bezoekers worden uitgenodigd om hun eigen lichtervaringen te projecteren en te cre\u00ebren in onze galerie. \r\nLive inktschilderij van de Japanse meesterschilder Keisuke Watanabe, vergezeld van een model en muziek","longdescr":"\u2022 Keisuke Watanabe woont en werkt in Kyoto, Japan.\r\nEen meestertekenaar staat bekend om zijn inkttekeningen die de energie van zijn modellen lijken te verbeelden door middel van dynamische lichaamsbewegingen. Als professionele muzikant ziet Watanabe schilderen door zijn muzikale ervaring. Zijn kunst is geboren uit klassieke muziek en ontwikkelt zich onder haar voortdurende invloed. Zijn wens om de verschillende toestanden van het menselijk lichaam in beweging te onderzoeken, zijn sensuele aantrekkingskracht wordt bevredigd door onvoorbereide schetsen ter plekke.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Yuiko R\u00e1yka woont en werkt in Kyoto, Japan.\r\nHet lichtwerk is een interactief en maakbaar installatiewerk dat kijkers zelf kunnen maken. De kijker gebruikt een zaklamp om het licht te laten schijnen op reflecterende materialen die in de tentoonstellingsruimte zijn ge\u00efnstalleerd en de illusionaire reflecties worden op de muren geprojecteerd. Deze actie en dit fenomeen wordt in dit werk \"Selfverse\" genoemd. De \"Selfverse\" is de eigen wereld van de kijker met oneindige mogelijkheden.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Art Y\u012b is een tijdgenoot kunstgalerij gelegen op de Kunstberg, naast het Centraal Station en op 100 meter van de Grote Markt. De galerij biedt een unieke mix van universele hedendaagse kunst. Een breed scala aan sculpturen en schilderijen van internationale kunstenaars wordt gepresenteerd.\r\n\r\nVoor meer informatie: https:\/\/www.art-yi.com\/viewing-room\/20-music-is-selfverse-exclusive-japanese-live-painting-and-light-shows\/","performers":"","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.art-yi.com","email":"info@art-yi.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550789"},"en":{"name":"Live Art Shows: Light Art and Japanese Painting","shortdescr":"Interactive Light Show from Japanese artist Yuiko R\u00e1yka. Visitors are invited to project and create your own light experiences in our gallery.\r\nLive ink painting from Japanese master painter Keisuke Watanabe, accompanied with a model and music","longdescr":"\u2022 Keisuke Watanabe lives and works in Kyoto, Japan.\r\nA master draughtsman is well known for his ink drawings which look to portray the energy of his models through dynamic bodily movement. Being a professional musician, Watanabe perceives painting through his musical experience. His art is born from classical music and develops under its constant influence. His wish to explore the different states of the human body in motion, its sensual appeal is satisfied by extemporaneous sketching on the spot. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Yuiko R\u00e1yka  lives and works in Kyoto, Japan.\r\nThe light work is an interactive and creatable installation work that viewers can create by themselves.\r\nThe viewer uses a flashlight to shine the light on reflective materials  installed in the exhibition room, and the illusionary reflections are projected on the walls. This action and phenomenon is called \"Selfverse\" in this work. The \"Selfverse\" is the viewer's own world of infinite possibilities.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Art Y\u012b is a contemporary art gallery located at Monts-des-Arts, next to the Central Station and 100m to the Grand Place. The gallery offers a unique fusion of universal contemporary art. A wide range of sculptures and paintings by international artists is presented.\r\n\r\nFor more information: https:\/\/www.art-yi.com\/viewing-room\/20-music-is-selfverse-exclusive-japanese-live-painting-and-light-shows\/","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.art-yi.com","email":"info@art-yi.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550789"},"de":{"name":"Spectacles d'Art en Direct\u00a0: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.art-yi.com","email":"info@art-yi.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550789"},"it":{"n