: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise ","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Spectacles d'Art en Direct\u00a0: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise ","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Spectacles d'Art en Direct\u00a0: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise ","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Spectacles d'Art en Direct\u00a0: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise ","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Spectacles d'Art en Direct\u00a0: Art de la Lumi\u00e8re et Peinture Japonaise ","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-02-11","doors":"13:00:00","start":"13:00:00","end":"15:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-02-16","doors":"19:00:00","start":"19:00:00","end":"21:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":0}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[11],"translations":{"fr":["Famille"],"nl":["Familie"],"en":["Family"],"de":["Familie"],"it":["Famiglie"],"sp":["Familias"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"opening":{"day":"2023-02-16","start":"19:00:00","timestamp":"2023-02-16T19:00:00+01:00","end":"21:00:00","is_only_by_appointment":false},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Assistenzhund","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe"],"it":["Accessibile","Cane guida","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti"],"sp":["Habilitado","Perros gu\u00eda","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos"],"pt":[null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-12T03:36:20+01:00","published_at":"2023-02-02T08:48:15+01:00","backoffice_id":270789,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.5503212081491},{"id":550331,"date_start":"2023-02-02","date_end":"2023-02-18","date_next":"2023-02-16","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater","it":"Teatro","sp":"Teatro","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[55],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de marionnettes"],"nl":["Poppentheater"],"en":["Puppet show"],"de":["Puppentheater"],"it":["Teatro delle marionette"],"sp":["Teatro de marionetas"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":"Parodie pour marionnettes, en bruxellois fran\u00e7ais.","longdescr":"C\u2019est en collaboration avec Auguste Maquet qu\u2019Alexandre Dumas \u00e9crit \"Les Trois Mousquetaires\". Ils ont pour nom Athos, Pothos et Aramis (tous ont exist\u00e9 mais n\u2019\u00e9taient pas de la m\u00eame g\u00e9n\u00e9ration) et sont au service de Louis XIII. Arriv\u00e9 de sa Gascogne natale sur un bidet jaune de robe, avec une lettre de recommandation de son gentilhomme de p\u00e8re pour M. de Tr\u00e9ville, capitaine des gardes, \u00e0 Paris, d\u2019Artagnan doit gagner sa belle casaque de mousquetaires. Il commencera par se battre en duel avec ceux qui deviendront ses ins\u00e9parables amis.\r\n\r\nL\u2019amour que d\u2019Artagnan porte \u00e0 Constance Bonacieux (Constanske chez Toone), fid\u00e8le femme de chambre d\u2019Anne d\u2019Autriche, le lance dans l\u2019aventure dite des \"Ferrets de la Reine\" : douze ferrets de diamants, pr\u00e9sents du roi, que la reine a offerts \u00e0 Buckingham. A l\u2019instigation du cardinal de Richelieu qui veut perdre la reine, Louis XIII somme son \u00e9pouse de les porter au prochain bal de la cour. Ces ferrets sont en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 des bouts m\u00e9talliques qui terminent des rubans. Dans le cas de la reine de France, ces ferrets sont orn\u00e9s de diamants.\r\n\r\nPour les commodit\u00e9s de la sc\u00e8ne et aussi par confusion de r\u00e9cits, ces ferrets se transforment chez les Toone du pass\u00e9 en collier de la reine. Cet \u00e9pisode na\u00eet probablement d\u2019un autre roman de Dumas : \"Le Collier de la Reine\" qui trouve sa source dans l\u2019Affaire du collier de 1785-1786, scandale qui \u00e9clata en France \u00e0 la fin de l\u2019Ancien R\u00e9gime, \u00e0 la suite d\u2019une escroquerie mont\u00e9e par la comtesse de la Motte aid\u00e9e de Cagliostro. Ces derniers convainquirent le cardinal de Rohan d\u2019acheter pour la reine un collier qu\u2019il ne put jamais rembourser. Cette affaire compromit la reine Marie-Antoinette qui \u00e9tait pourtant innocente.\r\n\r\nConfusion dans les r\u00e9cits, anachronisme font partie du quotidien des Toone. Ils ne s\u2019embarrassent gu\u00e8re de d\u00e9tails.\r\n\r\nComme disait Moli\u00e8re : \"L\u2019important, c\u2019est de plaire !\"\r\n\r\nDe nos jours encore, Toone respecte les anachronismes de ses pr\u00e9d\u00e9cesseurs.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"nl":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"en":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"de":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"it":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"sp":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"pt":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"},"cn":{"name":"Les Trois Mousquetaires","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550331"}},"place":{"id":231143,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Traditioneel marionettentheater Brusselse folklore - Typisch Staminee.\r\nMuseum van Toone: Gratis toegang voor het publiek tijdens de pauze.\r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone in Brussel is een origineel en authentiek poppentheater dat doorspekt is van Brusselse geschiedenis en cultuur! \r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone zet sinds 1830 de eeuwenoude traditie van het volkse Theater voort.\r\nDe programmatie is gebaseerd op grote toneelklassiekers zoals \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" van Edmond Rostand, \"De Drie Musketiers\" van Alexandre Dumas, \"Romeo en Julia\" van William Shakespeare en \"Tijl Uilenspiegel\" van Charles De Coster. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"During the Spanish occupation of the Netherlands all theaters were closed to prevent the actors from raising satirical pieces against the Spanish rulers. As a result, doll shows came into play: it was easier to tolerate the fierce dialogues when pronounced by lifeless dolls. About 1830 Antoine \"Toone\" Genty opened  a puppet theater, then in the Marolles. More than 180 years later, this popular entertainment has grown into a Royal Puppet Theater. After Genty, his (unrelated) successors would also be called Toone (Antoine).\r\nThe classics are performed in the local Brussels dialect with wooden puppets (the so-called poechenel), sometimes in Dutch or in French. The puppet theater and museum has been located near the Grand Place for four decades. The theater is located on the upper floors of the building, on the ground floor there is a pub. The museum contains old dolls, including 19th century specimens.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Marionettentheater - Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"W\u00e4hrend der spanischen Besetzung der Niederlande wurden zwangsweise s\u00e4mtliche Theater geschlossen, um Kritik - in Form von satirischen St\u00fccken - an den spanischen Herrschern zu unterbinden. Die Br\u00fcsseler haben alsdann die Schauspieler durch Marionetten (\"Poechenelles\" in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart) ersetzt, die in illegalen Theatern auftragen. \r\nAnfang des 19. Jahrhunderts z\u00e4hlten die Br\u00fcsseler Marionettentheater zu den beliebtesten Vergn\u00fcgungen f\u00fcr Erwachsene, denn sie boten eine enorme Freiheit, ben\u00f6tigen nur wenig finanzielle Mittel und konnten \u00fcberall aufgef\u00fchrt werden. Ihr Repertoire ist bis heute sehr vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von volkst\u00fcmlichen Legenden \u00fcber Rittergeschichten bis hin zu religi\u00f6sen oder historischen St\u00fccken, die sehr frei interpretiert werden. \r\nSeit der Gr\u00fcndung des Theaters im Marollenviertel ist nun bereits die 9. Puppenspielergeneration der Toone-Dynastie am Werk. Der jeweils neue Toone (Br\u00fcsseler Kosename f\u00fcr \"Antoine\", so der Vorname des Gr\u00fcnders) muss sowohl von seinem Vorg\u00e4nger als auch von dem Publikum angenommen werden - und so ist es nicht unbedingt der jeweilige Sohn, der die Nachfolge antritt. \r\nDie Klassiker werden in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart und manchmal auch auf Niederl\u00e4ndisch oder Franz\u00f6sisch aufgef\u00fchrt. \r\nDas Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone birgt auch ein urige Schenke und ein Marionettenmuseum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Teatro Reale di Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Traditional Brussels\u2019 puppet theater & museum - Typical caf\u00e9\r\nBordering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Real Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":[],"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":913,"location":{"lat":null,"lon":null},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-02-12T03:36:00+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:54+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":231143,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Traditioneel marionettentheater Brusselse folklore - Typisch Staminee.\r\nMuseum van Toone: Gratis toegang voor het publiek tijdens de pauze.\r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone in Brussel is een origineel en authentiek poppentheater dat doorspekt is van Brusselse geschiedenis en cultuur! \r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone zet sinds 1830 de eeuwenoude traditie van het volkse Theater voort.\r\nDe programmatie is gebaseerd op grote toneelklassiekers zoals \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" van Edmond Rostand, \"De Drie Musketiers\" van Alexandre Dumas, \"Romeo en Julia\" van William Shakespeare en \"Tijl Uilenspiegel\" van Charles De Coster. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"During the Spanish occupation of the Netherlands all theaters were closed to prevent the actors from raising satirical pieces against the Spanish rulers. As a result, doll shows came into play: it was easier to tolerate the fierce dialogues when pronounced by lifeless dolls. About 1830 Antoine \"Toone\" Genty opened  a puppet theater, then in the Marolles. More than 180 years later, this popular entertainment has grown into a Royal Puppet Theater. After Genty, his (unrelated) successors would also be called Toone (Antoine).\r\nThe classics are performed in the local Brussels dialect with wooden puppets (the so-called poechenel), sometimes in Dutch or in French. The puppet theater and museum has been located near the Grand Place for four decades. The theater is located on the upper floors of the building, on the ground floor there is a pub. The museum contains old dolls, including 19th century specimens.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Marionettentheater - Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"W\u00e4hrend der spanischen Besetzung der Niederlande wurden zwangsweise s\u00e4mtliche Theater geschlossen, um Kritik - in Form von satirischen St\u00fccken - an den spanischen Herrschern zu unterbinden. Die Br\u00fcsseler haben alsdann die Schauspieler durch Marionetten (\"Poechenelles\" in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart) ersetzt, die in illegalen Theatern auftragen. \r\nAnfang des 19. Jahrhunderts z\u00e4hlten die Br\u00fcsseler Marionettentheater zu den beliebtesten Vergn\u00fcgungen f\u00fcr Erwachsene, denn sie boten eine enorme Freiheit, ben\u00f6tigen nur wenig finanzielle Mittel und konnten \u00fcberall aufgef\u00fchrt werden. Ihr Repertoire ist bis heute sehr vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von volkst\u00fcmlichen Legenden \u00fcber Rittergeschichten bis hin zu religi\u00f6sen oder historischen St\u00fccken, die sehr frei interpretiert werden. \r\nSeit der Gr\u00fcndung des Theaters im Marollenviertel ist nun bereits die 9. Puppenspielergeneration der Toone-Dynastie am Werk. Der jeweils neue Toone (Br\u00fcsseler Kosename f\u00fcr \"Antoine\", so der Vorname des Gr\u00fcnders) muss sowohl von seinem Vorg\u00e4nger als auch von dem Publikum angenommen werden - und so ist es nicht unbedingt der jeweilige Sohn, der die Nachfolge antritt. \r\nDie Klassiker werden in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart und manchmal auch auf Niederl\u00e4ndisch oder Franz\u00f6sisch aufgef\u00fchrt. \r\nDas Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone birgt auch ein urige Schenke und ein Marionettenmuseum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Teatro Reale di Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Traditional Brussels\u2019 puppet theater & museum - Typical caf\u00e9\r\nBordering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Real Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_