r du b\u00e2timent Flagey. La galeriste et curatrice Sandrine Viu Masia aime partir \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de jeunes artistes talentueux avant de les pr\u00e9senter dans des expositions de qualit\u00e9. Une attention particuli\u00e8re est port\u00e9e \u00e0 l'accueil du public et \u00e0 sa compr\u00e9hension de la symbiose entre le lieu et les \u0153uvres expos\u00e9es.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"The Palm Beach","address_street_name":"Meyerbeerstraat","address_street_number":"61","address_street_box":null,"email":"sandrineviumasia@me.com","website":"http:\/\/www.thepalmbeach.be","phone_contact":"+32 474 86 42 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Meyerbeerstraat, 61","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"The Palm Beach is een atypische galerie gevestigd in een art deco huis van Joseph Diongre, de ontwerper van het Flageygebouw. Sandrine Viu Masia, curator van de galerie, zoekt  jong talent en stelt hen voor in kwalitatieve, niet-alledaagse tentoonstellingen. Er wordt bijzondere aandacht besteed aan de ontvangst van het publiek en aan de duiding van de symbiose tussen de plaats en de tentoongestelde werken. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"The Palm Beach","address_street_name":"Rue Meyerbeer","address_street_number":"61","address_street_box":null,"email":"sandrineviumasia@me.com","website":"http:\/\/www.thepalmbeach.be","phone_contact":"+32 474 86 42 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Rue Meyerbeer, 61","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"The Palm Beach is an atypical gallery located in an Art Deco house designed by Joseph Diongre, the architect of the Flagey building. Sandrine Viu Masia, the curator of the place, enjoys discovering young talented artists and introducing them to the public in quality ex