nce dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Barrierefrei","Anpassungen f\u00fcr blinde und sehbehinderte Menschen","Assistenzhund","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":["Accessibile alle persone con difficolt\u00e0 di comprensione","Accessibile","Disposizioni per persone non vedenti e ipovedenti","Cane guida","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Habilitado","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-11T09:06:10+01:00","published_at":"2023-01-27T10:29:43+01:00","backoffice_id":270449,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":550670,"date_start":"2023-02-18","date_end":"2023-02-19","date_next":"2023-02-18","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":57,"translations":{"fr":"Clubbing","nl":"Clubbing","en":"Clubbing","de":"Clubbing","it":"Locali notturni","sp":"Ir de discoteca","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":"La Battle 80's vs 90's vs 90's","longdescr":"Samedi 18 F\u00e9vrier 2023 - Grande premi\u00e8re au Cactus Club.\r\nLa Grande BATTLE - 3 Dj\u2019s \r\n\u2796\u2796\u2796\u2796\u2796\u2796\u2796\u2796\u2796\r\n80\u2019s : Dj Phil Harlet \r\n90\u2019s : Dj Maestro \r\n00\u2019s : Dj G-Froy\r\n\r\nRetrouvez nos 3 Dj\u2019s sp\u00e9cialistes de chacune des d\u00e9cennies qui vont s\u2019affronter lors d\u2019une Battle 80\u2019s VS 90\u2019s VS 00\u2019s.\r\n\r\nVenez d\u00e9fendre votre d\u00e9cennie pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e. \r\nUne Ambiance de Folie garantie avec 3 Dj\u2019s exceptionnels.\r\n\r\nOuverture des portes 22:30. \r\nParking Gratuit.\r\nR\u00e9servation de tables VIP : 0475 28 41 24","performers":"Dj Phil Harlet \r\nDj Maestro \r\nDj G-Froy","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 475 28 41 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"nl":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"en":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"de":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"it":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"sp":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"pt":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"},"cn":{"name":"Battle - 3 Dj's - 80's vs 90's vs 00's","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","email":"info@cactus-club.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550670"}},"place":{"id":264647,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Depuis 25 ans les soir\u00e9es du Cactus Club (nomm\u00e9e ainsi d'apr\u00e8s une chanson de Dutronc) sont r\u00e9put\u00e9es pour leurs ambiances et leurs diversit\u00e9s musicales. Il y a des soir\u00e9es \u00e0 th\u00e8me tous les 15 jours.\r\nLe b\u00e2timent date de 1923 et a connu une longue vie d\u00e9vou\u00e9e au divertissement: apr\u00e8s ses d\u00e9buts avec la salle de f\u00eates Casino le lieu est devenu un cin\u00e9ma, les G\u00e9meaux, en '66 (Polnareff, Herbert L\u00e9onard, Julie Driscoll, Wallace Collection ... etc y ont chant\u00e9s). Ensuite c'est devenu le Canotier et enfin le Cactus depuis 1986 cr\u00e9\u00e9 par Eric Doolaege. Son associ\u00e9 Philippe Harlet fait partie de l'histoire du Cactus, \u00e9tant le Deejay permanent depuis le d\u00e9but de l'aventure il a grandement particip\u00e9 au succ\u00e8s de la discoth\u00e8que. \r\n","description_print":"* Concept\r\nDepuis 25 ans les Soir\u00e9es du Cactus Club sont R\u00e9put\u00e9es pour leurs Ambiances et leurs Diversit\u00e9s Musicales - Soir\u00e9es \u00e0 Th\u00e8me Tous les 15 jours - Entr\u00e9e Gratuite pour tous avant Minuit. \r\n\r\n* Resident Deejays\r\nDeeJay's Davy-D (NRJ Party Time), Looda et Duty Jo\r\n\r\n* Musique \r\nHits & Club Music\r\n\r\n* Entr\u00e9e\r\nTenues correctes & attitudes ad\u00e9quates exig\u00e9es\r\n\r\n* Parking\r\nPossibilit\u00e9 de se garer aux alentours du club et sur le Parking du \"Carrefour\".\r\n\r\n* Booking Table VIP : info@cactus-club.be\r\n\r\nHistorique\r\n\r\nFond\u00e9 en 1986.\r\n\r\n\"Ce b\u00e2timent date de 1923 et \u00e0 d'abord abrit\u00e9 la salle de f\u00eates Casino avant de devenir un cin\u00e9ma ,les G\u00e9meaux en 66 ( Polnareff,Herbert L\u00e9onard, Julie Driscoll, Wallace Collection ....etc , y ont chant\u00e9s ), le Canotier et enfin le Cactus depuis 1986 cr\u00e9\u00e9 par Eric Doolaege . Je voulais un nom court et la chanson de Dutronc m'a inspir\u00e9e. Philippe Harlet fait partie de l'histoire du Cactus, \u00e9tant le Deejay permanent depuis le d\u00e9but de l'aventure il a grandement particip\u00e9 au succ\u00e8s de la discoth\u00e8que. Actuellement le Cactus est toujours exploit\u00e9 par Eric Doolaege et son associ\u00e9 Philippe Harlet .\"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Vorstlaan","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"