e","Disposizioni per persone non vedenti e ipovedenti","Disposizioni per persone non udenti e ipoudenti","Cane guida","Accessibile ai pedoni con supporti","WC idoneo"],"sp":["Habilitado para personas con dificultades de comprensi\u00f3n","Equipos para personas con problemas de visi\u00f3n y audici\u00f3n","Equipos para personas sordas y con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Perros gu\u00eda","Habilitado para peatones con aud\u00edfonos","Ba\u00f1os adaptados"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-12T03:05:24+01:00","published_at":"2021-05-12T09:11:18+02:00","backoffice_id":231490,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.1399912277661},{"id":546394,"date_start":"2022-12-03","date_end":"2023-12-23","date_next":"2023-02-18","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[258],"translations":{"fr":["Quartiers"],"nl":["Wijken"],"en":["Neighbourhoods"],"de":["Stadtteile"],"it":["Quartieri"],"sp":["Barrios"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Tour du samedi - D\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles, ses incontournables et sentiers moins battus \u00e0 v\u00e9lo et laissez-vous surprendre !","longdescr":"Cette visite guid\u00e9e \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est l\u2019introduction id\u00e9ale \u00e0 Bruxelles, son histoire et ses nombreux quartiers. Un m\u00e9lange original entre les incontournables tels que le quartier des Marolles, le March\u00e9 aux Poissons, le Palais de Justice,... et les sentiers moins battus de la ville. Ce tour vous offre une vue surprenante sur la ville, son patrimoine et sa diversit\u00e9. \r\n\r\n\u00c0 mi-parcours, les v\u00e9los sont mis de c\u00f4t\u00e9 pour une pause dans un bar sympathique ou sur une terrasse.  \r\n\r\nD\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne l'imaginez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo ! \r\n\r\nInfos pratiques: \r\n- Tous les samedis, tours en FR, NL et EN\r\n- Avec votre propre v\u00e9lo ou un v\u00e9lo classique ou e-bike \u00e0 nous\r\n- Dur\u00e9e: 3h30\r\n- D\u00e9part et arriv\u00e9e dans le centre-ville au Grand Hospice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"nl":{"name":"Zaterdagtour - Ontdek Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":"Ontdek Brussel, langs highlights en minder betreden paden met de fiets en laat je verrassen!","longdescr":"De zaterdagtour is een ideale kennismaking met Brussel, haar diversiteit aan wijken en haar vele gezichten. Onze gidsen maken van deze tour een boeiende mix tussen highlights zoals de Marollen, de Vismarkt of het Justitiepaleis en de minder betreden paden van de stad. Een verrassende blik op de stad en haar veelzijdigheid want Brussel is veel meer dan haar klassieke highlights!\r\n\r\nHalverwege de tour gaan de fietsen aan de kant voor een pauze in een gezellige bar of terrasje.\r\n\r\nOntdek meer dan je zou verwachten, met de fiets!\r\n\r\nPraktische info: \r\n- Elke zaterdag tours in NL, FR en EN\r\n- Met je eigen fiets of een klassieke fiets of e-bike van ons\r\n- Duur: 3u30\r\n- Vertrek en einde in het stadscentrum, Grand Hospice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"en":{"name":"Saturday tour - Discover Brussels by bike","shortdescr":"Discover Brussels, its highlights and less beaten tracks by bike and let yourself be surprised!","longdescr":"The Saturday tour is an ideal introduction to Brussels, its various neighbourhoods and many identities. During this tour, our guides offer you an interesting mix between highlights such as the Marolles, the Fish Market or the Palace of Justice and hidden gems along the city's less beaten tracks. A surprising view on the city, its heritage and versatility.\r\n\r\nThe bikes are set aside halfway the tour for a break at a cosy bar or terrace. \r\n\r\nDiscover more than you can imagine by bike!\r\n\r\nPractical info: \r\n- Every Saturday, tours in EN, FR and NL\r\n- With your own bike or with one of our classic or e-bikes\r\n- Time: 3h30\r\n- Start and end of the tours in the city center, Grand Hospice","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"de":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"it":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"sp":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"pt":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"},"cn":{"name":"Higlights en minder betreden paden van Brussel met de fiets","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/weekend-tours","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546394"}},"place":{"id":277608,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est une association de guides b\u00e9n\u00e9voles locaux ayant \u00e0 c\u0153ur Bruxelles et le v\u00e9lo. Ils partagent avec enthousiasme leur passion pour la ville et le v\u00e9lo avec des visiteurs de Bruxelles et d\u2019autres Bruxellois. A v\u00e9lo ils trouvent le rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience authentique \u00e0 Bruxelles. Avant tout, ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent vous guider hors des chemins battus et cela dans une ambiance conviviale. Vivez Bruxelles dans toute sa splendeur \u00e0 v\u00e9lo et d\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne le pensez.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is een vereniging van lokale vrijwillige gidsen met een passie voor Brussel en de fiets. Ze delen hun passie voor de stad en het fietsen enthousiast met bezoekers van Brussel en andere Brusselaars. Op hun fietsen vinden ze het juiste tempo om u onder te dompelen in de stad en u een authentieke Brusselse ervaring te bieden. Bovenal begeleiden ze jullie graag buiten de gebaande paden in een vriendelijke sfeer. Beleef Brussel in al zijn pracht per fiets en ontdek meer dan jullie denken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is an association of local volunteer guides with a passion for Brussels and cycling. They enthusiastically share their passion for the city and cycling with visitors to Brussels and other Brussels residents. On their bikes they find the right pace to immerse you in the city and offer an authentic Brussels experience. Above all, they prefer to guide you off the beaten track in a friendly atmosphere. Experience Brussels in all its splendour by bike and discover more than you think.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":["Centro"],"sp":["Centro"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":37608,"location":{"lat":50.85351136,"lon":4.35012167},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-02-12T02:35:33+01:00","published_at":"2022-01-17T17:56:22+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250146,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D6","email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7\/D6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cactus Bruxelles \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est une association bruxelloise de guides b\u00e9n\u00e9voles locaux ayant \u00e0 coeur Bruxelles et le v\u00e9lo.\r\nIls partagent avec enthousiasme leur passion pour la ville et le v\u00e9lo avec les visiteurs de la ville et les autres Bruxellois. Ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience et une introduction authentique \u00e0 Bruxelles. A v\u00e9lo ils trouvent le rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et sa diversit\u00e9.\r\nAvant tout, ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent vous guider le long des chemins les moins battus de Bruxelles et cela dans une ambiance conviviale. D\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles pleinement et d\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne le pensez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo !\r\nZaterdagtour","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D6","email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7\/D6","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is een Brusselse vereniging van lokale vrijwilligersgidsen met een hart voor Brussel en de fiets.\r\nHun passie voor de stad en de fiets delen ze met veel enthousiasme met bezoekers van de stad en andere Brusselaars. Ze bieden een authentieke ervaring en kennismaking met Brussel en vinden met de fiets het ideale ritme om je onder te dompelen in het veelzijdige Brussel. Liefst van al gidsen ze je langs de minder begane paden de stad in een gemoedelijke sfeer. Beleef Brussel ten volle met te fiets en ontdek meer dan je verwacht!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D6","email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7\/D6","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Cactus Brussels \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is an association of local guides with a heart for Brussels\r\nand the bicycle. During their guided bike tours, the guide-volunteers share their passion\r\nfor Brussels and the bicycle with both locals and visitors to the city. They offer an authentic\r\nexperience of Brussels and, thanks to the bicycle, they find the ideal rhythm to immerse you\r\nin this surprising capital. Their favorite way to surprise you is with an convivial bike tour\r\nalong the city's less beaten tracks. You can also choose from one of the various themed bike\r\ntours on offer or opt for a tour tailored to your group. The bike tours are ideal to integrate\r\ninto a teambuilding with your company or organization, to get inspired by the multifaceted\r\nBrussels or to discover the city with family and friends.\r\nExperience Brussels to the full by bike and discover more than you expect!\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D6","email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7\/D6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":"D6","email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http: