r les figures f\u00e9minines de l\u2019Alg\u00e9rie avec une visite guid\u00e9e de l\u2019exposition \"Arwah t'chim rihet lebled\" (viens sentir l'odeur du pays). \r\n\r\nUn moment de sororit\u00e9 entre femmes, ouvert \u00e0 toutes.\r\nL\u2019entr\u00e9e se fait \u00e0 prix libre (pay what you can), on vous offre le th\u00e9 ! \r\n\r\nPlus d'infos sur la page de l'\u00e9v\u00e8nement : https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/2BVaL40NQ","performers":"Zineb Ghennai ; Dounia DJ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/medexmuseum\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551216"},"nl":{"name":"Entre femmes : apr\u00e8s-midi dansant & d\u00e9fil\u00e9 de robes traditionnelles alg\u00e9riennes","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/medexmuseum\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551216"},"en":{"name":"Entre femmes : apr\u00e8s-midi dansant & d\u00e9fil\u00e9 de robes traditionnelles alg\u00e9riennes","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/medexmuseum\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551216"},"de":{"name":"Entre femmes : apr\u00e8s-midi dansant & d\u00e9fil\u00e9 de robes traditionnelles alg\u00e9riennes","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/medexmuseum\/","email":"medexmuseum@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.551216"},"it":{"name":"Entre femmes : apr\u00e8s-midi dansant & d\u00e9fil\u00e9 de robes traditionnelles alg\u