arde***","longdescr":"***Joni \u00cele (Fr) Bedroom Post Punk***\r\nJoni \u00cele : 1. Name describing states of mind thrown unscrupulously on major chords. 2. Indie bedroom, handmade and spontaneous. 3. Person living in their bedroom like Robinson Cruso\u00e9 in the Pacific ocean. 4. Name that can refer to one or three persons. 5. Islander coming from Lille and listening to Courtney Barnett, Daniel Johnston, Frankie Cosmos, Alain Bashung and many other. 6. Instrumental ensemble : minimalist drum kit, bass, guitar, synthesiser and voices. 7. To know how to swim.\r\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=nsztW4LOsog\r\nhttps:\/\/open.spotify.com\/artist\/3wPx3PIppRVUJ5tPWXJGYv...\r\nhttps:\/\/joniile.bandcamp.com\/\r\n--- --- ---\r\n***Refurinn Kitsune (Be) Electro Avant Garde***\r\n\"Refurinn Kitsune, projet solo de Cha! (LEM, Cha!Selektor, Scraboutcha) est un isthme improbable entre deux eaux : \u00e0 b\u00e2bord, le minimalisme m\u00e9lancolique d'une pop vocale fantasm\u00e9e ; \u00e0 tribord l'\u00e9lectro-bricolage d'une passionn\u00e9e du son. \u00c0 la fois intime et ludique, \u00e9vanescent et terrien - par ses \u00e9chos, ses accrocs - Refurinn Kitsune est un fragile jeu d'amour et de hasard, contenant un parfait dosage de folie.\" Luvan\r\nhttps:\/\/youtu.be\/91vhwNZzyZY\r\nhttps:\/\/youtu.be\/ufFahaqVbgM\r\nhttps:\/\/zamzamrec.bandcamp.com\/...\/spacelight-shines...\r\nhttps:\/\/soundcloud.com\/refurinn-kitsune\r\n--- --- ---\r\nA partir de 19:30 \/\/ 8 Euros\r\n(Nobody gets turned away for lack of funds)\u2028\r\nPlease bring CASH!","performers":"***Joni \u00cele (Fr) Bedroom Post Punk***\r\n***Refurinn Kitsune (Be) Electro Avant Garde***","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"superconcertbxl@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548261"},"nl":{"name":"Joni \u00cele (Fr) + Refurinn Kitsune (Be)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url"