e9vrier 2023.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.besneax.be\/belgian-sneakers-days\/belgian-sneakers-days-2023\/","email":"besneax@besneax.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545097"},"nl":{"name":"Belgian Sneakers Days","shortdescr":"De Belgian Sneakers Days zijn 4 dagen gewijd aan sneakers & sportswear fans binnen de LGBTQIA+ community. Deze 3e editie belooft nog groter te worden dan de vorige.","longdescr":"#BEsneax is opgericht op 23 februari 2018. In 2023 vieren we dan ook het 5 jarig bestaan van de vereniging zoals het hoort. De Belgian Sneakers Days zullen de gelegenheid zijn om terug te komen voor een 3de editie in Brussel. Let op: de verkiezing van Mr Sneakers Belgium zal plaatsvinden op zaterdag 25 februari 2023.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.besneax.be\/belgian-sneakers-days\/belgian-sneakers-days-2023\/","email":"besneax@besneax.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545097"},"en":{"name":"Belgian Sneakers Days","shortdescr":"The Belgian Sneakers Days are 4 days dedicated to sneakers & sportswear lovers within the LGBTQIA+ community. This 3rd edition promises to be even bigger than the previous ones.","longdescr":"#BEsneax was founded on 23 February 2018. In 2023, we'll therefore celebrate the 5th anniversary of the association as it should be. The Belgian Sneakers Days will be the occasion coming back for a 3rd edition in Brussels. Note that the election of Mr Sneakers Belgium will take place on Saturday 25 February 2023.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.besneax.be\/belgian-sneakers-days\/belgian-sneakers-days-2023\/","email":"besneax@besneax.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545097"},"de":{"name":"Belgian Sn