ail.550135"},"nl":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":"Jam voor dansers en muzikanten","longdescr":"Drie dansers en drie muzikanten ontmoeten elkaar in het caf\u00e9 van Zinnema en zorgen voor een funky opening van de jam. Konfituur nodigt Brusselse dansers en muzikanten uit om mee te gaan in hun vibe. Dit terwijl het publiek kan genieten van de synergie die ontstaat op het podium.\r\n\r\n*Check social media om te kijken welke artiesten (muzikanten en dansers) de jam openen en welke instrumenten die avond reeds aanwezig zijn op podium.\r\n\r\nVrije toegang!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 06 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"},"en":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"},"de":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"},"it":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"},"sp":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"},"pt":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"},"cn":{"name":"Konfituur","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","email":"info@zinnema.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.550135"}},"place":{"id":3232,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Zinnema","address_street_name":"Rue de Veeweyde","address_street_number":"24 26","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@zinnema.be","website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 555 06 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 555 06 00","address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Veeweyde, 24 26","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":"Zinnema, Maison Ouverte aux Talents \u00e0 Bruxelles, soutient, d\u00e9veloppe et fait conna\u00eetre des projets d\u2019individus et groupes qui donnent libre cours \u00e0 leur imagination dans l\u2019une ou l\u2019autre discipline artistique \u00e0 Bruxelles ou son environnement.  Cela se passe bottom-up, par des initiatives propres, des workshops ou par leur travail de soutien.\r\nPersuad\u00e9s de l\u2019importance et de la force de l\u2019ouverture, la diversit\u00e9, l\u2019encadrement professionnel, la co\u00f6p\u00e9ration et la qualit\u00e9, Zinnema appr\u00e9cie les artistes et encourage en m\u00eame temps le renouvellement et l\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation dans le laboratoire urbain dynamique qui s\u2019appelle Bruxelles.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Zinnema","address_street_name":"Veeweidestraat","address_street_number":"24 26","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@zinnema.be","website":"http:\/\/www.zinnema.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 555 06 00","phone_