[11],"translations":{"fr":["Famille"],"nl":["Familie"],"en":["Family"],"de":["Familie"],"it":["Famiglie"],"sp":["Familias"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"visit_profile":{"list":[328],"translations":{"fr":["Vert & durable"],"nl":["Groen & duurzaam"],"en":["Green & sustainable"],"de":["Gr\u00fcn & nachhaltig"],"it":["Green e sostenibile"],"sp":["Ecol\u00f3gico y sostenible"],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"tags":["exterior","kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2023-02-12T02:08:14+01:00","published_at":"2022-10-03T17:00:16+02:00","backoffice_id":262990,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.13769993714281},{"id":537531,"date_start":"2020-09-15","date_end":"2024-06-30","date_next":"2024-06-30","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":"Visite guidate","sp":"Visitas guiadas","pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en","es"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Escape game urbain - Coddy","shortdescr":"Explore la ville tout en jouant!","longdescr":"Ces aventures urbaines t\u2019invitent, en \u00e9quipe de 2 \u00e0 6 joueurs, \u00e0 parcourir la ville en suivant un sc\u00e9nario qui te plongera dans un univers ou un r\u00f4le particulier (apocalyptique, moyen\u00e2geux, futuriste \/ un enqu\u00eateur, un alchimiste, etc.). Ta mission ? T\u2019\u00e9chapper avant la fin du chrono ou simplement r\u00e9soudre toutes les \u00e9nigmes dans le temps imparti ! Laisse-toi guider par l\u2019app (gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la carte int\u00e9gr\u00e9e et la boussole), trouve les points d\u2019int\u00e9r\u00eats o\u00f9 t\u2019attendent les missions et les \u00e9nigmes et observe bien autour de toi : les r\u00e9ponses se cachent aussi dans la ville. \r\n\r\nSi tu veux passer un bon moment en famille, entre amis, ou m\u00eame entre coll\u00e8gues, opte pour un Escape Game urbain avec Coddy ! L\u2019activit\u00e9 est s\u00e9curis\u00e9e d\u2019un point de vue sanitaire, car tu ne joues qu\u2019avec les membres de ton \u00e9quipe en plein air. C\u2019est une activit\u00e9 qui m\u00eale le jeu et la visite de la ville car tu passeras par plein d\u2019endroits diff\u00e9rents. Une occasion de (re)d\u00e9couvrir la ville et l'explorer autrement","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coddygames.com","email":"hello@coddygames.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537531"},"nl":{"name":"Citywide escape games - Coddy","shortdescr":"Een Urban Escape Game om de stad op een leuke manier te verkennen!","longdescr":"Deze stedelijke avonturen nodigen je uit om, in teams van 2 tot 6 spelers, de stad te verkennen volgens een scenario dat je onderdompelt in een bepaald universum of een bepaalde rol (apocalyptisch, middeleeuws, futuristisch \/ een speurder, een alchemist, enzovoort). Je missie? Ontsnappen voor het einde van de timer of gewoon alle raadsels oplossen in een bepaalde tijd! Laat je leiden door de app (dankzij de ge\u00efntegreerde kaart en kompas), zoek de bezienswaardigheden waar de missies en raadsels op je wachten en kijk goed om je heen: de antwoorden zijn ook verborgen in de stad. \r\n\r\nWil je een leuke tijd beleven met je familie, vrienden of zelfs collega's, kies dan voor een urban Escape Game met Coddy! De activiteit is veilig vanuit gezondheidsoogpunt, want je speelt alleen met je teamleden in de buitenlucht. Het is een activiteit die het spel mengt met een bezoek aan de stad, want u komt op veel verschillende plaatsen. Een kans om de stad te (her)ontdekken en haar op een andere manier te verkennen","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coddygames.com","email":"hello@coddygames.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537531"},"en":{"name":"Citywide escape games - Coddy","shortdescr":"An Urban Escape Game to explore the city in a fun way!","longdescr":"These urban adventures invite you, in teams of 2 to 6 players, to explore the city following a scenario that will immerse you in a particular universe or role (apocalyptic, medieval, futuristic \/ an investigator, an alchemist, etc.). Your mission? Escape before the timer runs out or simply solve all the riddles in the time allowed! Let yourself be guided by the app (thanks to the integrated map and compass), find the points of interest where the missions and riddles await you and look around carefully: the answers are also hidden in the city. \r\n\r\nIf you want to have a good time with your family, friends or even colleagues, opt for an urban Escape Game with Coddy! The activity is safe from a health point of view, because you only play with your team members in the open air. It's an activity that mixes the game with a visit of the city because you'll go through many different places. An opportunity to (re)discover the city and explore it in a different way","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coddygames.com","email":"hello@coddygames.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537531"},"de":{"name":"Escape game urbain - Coddy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coddygames.com","email":"hello@coddygames.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.537531"},"it":{"name":"Escape game urbain - Coddy","s