 r\u00e9alisent des missions bas\u00e9es sur des sc\u00e9narios d\u2019environ 2 heures \u00e0 jouer entre amis ou en famille et explorent ainsi des coins moins connus de la ville tout en \u00e9lucidant des enqu\u00eates ancr\u00e9es \u00e0 la ville et \u00e0 ses lieux. \r\n\r\nPrix : 40 euros par \u00e9quipe de max 6 personnes","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coddy \u2013 Urban Escape Games","address_street_name":"Grand Place","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@coddygames.com","website":"https:\/\/www.coddygames.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 621 01 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grand Place","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Coddy biedt urban escape games op smartphone. \r\n\r\nSterke punten:\r\n- Verkenning van weinig bekende plaatsen in de stad \r\n- Puzzels en missies op basis van verschillende thema's en scenario's \r\n- Speel met je team met inachtneming van de regels van afstand. \r\n\r\nSpelers lossen puzzels op en voltooien missies op basis van scenario's die ongeveer 2 uur duren om met vrienden of familie te spelen en minder bekende hoeken van de stad te verkennen, terwijl ze de onderzoeken die in de stad en haar plaatsen geworteld zijn, ophelderen. \r\n\r\nPrijs: 40 euro per team van max. 6 personen","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coddy \u2013 Urban Escape Games","address_street_name":"Grand Place","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@coddygames.com","website":"https:\/\/www.coddygames.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 621 01 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grand Place","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Coddy offers urban escape games on smartphone. \r\n\r\nTheir advantages\r\n- Exploring lesser-known locations in the city \r